/repos/soulcodex/agentic/commits/65aa410ad5c6bfa2de168faf9aa2bcc91bdf9554/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T18:27:14Z","email":"info@soulcodex.es","name":"Roberto Jose Garcia Navarro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T18:30:20Z","email":"info@soulcodex.es","name":"Roberto Jose Garcia Navarro"},"message":"feat(skills): add specialized code review skills with project-map orientation\n\n- Add project-map skill to write .agentic/project-map.md for instant\n  codebase orientation on any subsequent agent invocation. Added to all\n  23 profiles as a default skill (T-0 value from first deploy).\n- Add code-review-go: goroutine lifecycle, data races, context propagation,\n  error wrapping, interface segregation, init() abuse, primitive obsession.\n- Add code-review-typescript: type safety (any/strict/noUncheckedIndexedAccess),\n  ESM/CJS, floating promises, money/precision, domain boundary violations.\n- Add code-review-python: type annotations, mutable defaults, async blocking I/O,\n  GIL thread safety, domain modeling with dataclass/Pydantic.\n- Add code-review-php: strict_types, PHPStan level 8, PSR compliance,\n  ORM/domain boundary violations, readonly value objects.\n- Add code-review-architecture: hexagonal boundary violations, DDD anti-patterns\n  (anemic model, God aggregate, primitive obsession), CQRS misuse, microservices\n  coupling (shared DB, missing timeouts/circuit breakers, non-idempotent consumers).\n- Upgrade code-review skill to v2.0.0 orchestrator: detects language and\n  architecture at Step 0 via project-map, routes to specialized skills,\n  applies generic checklist as universal baseline.\n- All findings use critical/high/medium/low risk levels with inline source\n  citations (Go spec, PEPs, TypeScript Handbook, PHP Manual, PSR, Fowler,\n  Evans, AWS Builders Library, microservices.io, Azure Architecture Center).\n- Mermaid stateDiagram-v2 for concurrency/state-machine issues in all review skills.\n- Sandwich communication: positives first, findings by severity, actionable path.\n- Update docs/skills.md with 6 new Development entries.\n- Regenerate index/skills.json (58 skills, up from 51).\n\nCloses #165","tree":{"sha":"a4e857500ae7b83502e07e1d94c44abc45a75715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soulcodex/agentic/git/trees/a4e857500ae7b83502e07e1d94c44abc45a75715"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soulcodex/agentic/git/commits/65aa410ad5c6bfa2de168faf9aa2bcc91bdf9554","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47703157?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/soulcodex","id":47703157,"login":"soulcodex","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAzMTU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soulcodex","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/soulcodex/agentic/commit/65aa410ad5c6bfa2de168faf9aa2bcc91bdf9554","node_id":"C_kwDORbT-_9oAKDY1YWE0MTBhZDVjNmJmYTJkZTE2OGZhZjlhYTJiY2M5MWJkZjk1NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/soulcodex/agentic/commit/d3619098fde2eed90378b2d5dfbe6b358589b9ee","sha":"d3619098fde2eed90378b2d5dfbe6b358589b9ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soulcodex/agentic/commits/d3619098fde2eed90378b2d5dfbe6b358589b9ee"}],"sha":"65aa410ad5c6bfa2de168