s\n- Semgrep — SAST with SARIF upload to GitHub Security tab\n- Trivy — secret and misconfiguration scanning with SARIF upload\n\n* fix(ci): fix semgrep job — install via pip instead of container, fix timeout unit","tree":{"sha":"30f43df5ddb136f2ca0319522b668d1529147269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soulcodex/agentic/git/trees/30f43df5ddb136f2ca0319522b668d1529147269"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/soulcodex/agentic/git/commits/59430863ee593efd70456f03ebaaec534c0682e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 30f43df5ddb136f2ca0319522b668d1529147269\nparent 97643f91dcce8715b6fae52d1a635870754fb68c\nauthor Roberto Garcia <47703157+soulcodex@users.noreply.github.com> 1776203919 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776203919 +0200\n\nfix(docs/ci): remove fork requirement from README; replace CodeQL with shell-aware SAST (#43)\n\n* fix(docs): remove fork requirement from README install instructions\n\n* chore(ci): replace CodeQL with ShellCheck + Semgrep + Trivy SAST workflow\n\nCodeQL does not support shell scripts as an analysable language and the\nonly .go file in the repo has ''//go:build ignore''. The new sast.yml runs:\n- ShellCheck (via reviewdog) — shell-specific linting with PR annotations\n- Semgrep — SAST with SARIF upload to GitHub Security tab\n- Trivy — secret and misconfiguration scanning with SARIF upload\n\n* fix(ci): fix semgrep job — install via pip instead of container, fix timeout unit","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp3riQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANHgQABsxlPNgVvk+t1610LnRucUl\njQxiZQI7FUAzjSsAaRMNra+fLfbdP/TgC24JKi9fd3+KaA8MV+4T8dnvKYIzQOPk\nE/3k3wZRxp/c1Ri+nMhs6u/OJJYI+IEf7lCVZCKimUmlkWEhd3mfjJm6zRswPjTp\nGRJPcrpaLZDd2wXZhKQT0PwSFXXQOf68s0eGYFr8IKBvrDX6YYqYTHqUgetNUFu4\nYInYGrbadXI5jtwG4FGyQB5IYOMwl8zC7K1PRzRXLx7rB7nWBayJAytWIAaAEl9C\nOKyfF+K2emfBhmooBJSjuwhB2+Inhl13wCkVVp07Uy2WeM7z6mXgw6G9ffJV17uj\nK1/Qgkedaig4buWjV8r8CDHpMjUgGGpnb5vK5qHN/IO/Pwl719A2a/RU6qFt5V3i\ncwhqW73pyLYbCqKFxK2MEysJv4OE+7PUfFv