platform/commit/36a36ce846ace7b143bc8c5921590d5f047c2939","node_id":"C_kwDORbVWGNoAKDM2YTM2Y2U4NDZhY2U3YjE0M2JjOGM1OTIxNTkwZDVmMDQ3YzI5Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/commit/dab4929b18c7c0053d264f7e35e3fb48bfadde9c","sha":"dab4929b18c7c0053d264f7e35e3fb48bfadde9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/commits/dab4929b18c7c0053d264f7e35e3fb48bfadde9c"}],"sha":"36a36ce846ace7b143bc8c5921590d5f047c2939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/commits/36a36ce846ace7b143bc8c5921590d5f047c2939"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/commits/dab4929b18c7c0053d264f7e35e3fb48bfadde9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T09:50:24Z","email":"baiyingzhu1110@gmail.com","name":"Cindy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T09:50:24Z","email":"baiyingzhu1110@gmail.com","name":"Cindy"},"message":"feat: dynamic sub-app registry with Supabase backend and admin UI\n\n- Add Supabase-backed API for apps/deployments/environments CRUD\n- Add admin pages for managing registered apps, deployments, environments\n- Add zip upload deployment and Vercel webhook auto-deploy\n- Switch sub-app loading from static config to dynamic API fetch\n- Add wujie lifecycle hooks to sub-goods and sub-supplier\n- Add sub-app template and Supabase schema","tree":{"sha":"597a8cc539eb2bd9932097416508639dc0a0d507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/git/trees/597a8cc539eb2bd9932097416508639dc0a0d507"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/git/commits/dab4929b18c7c0053d264f7e35e3fb48bfadde9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/commit/dab4929b18c7c0053d264f7e35e3fb48bfadde9c","node_id":"C_kwDORbVWGNoAKGRhYjQ5MjliMThjN2MwMDUzZDI2NGY3ZTM1ZTNmYjQ4YmZhZGRlOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/commit/a57f45f2ad919b5b7c7de77e0db243771bdcd946","sha":"a57f45f2ad919b5b7c7de77e0db243771bdcd946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/commits/a57f45f2ad919b5b7c7de77e0db243771bdcd946"}],"sha":"dab4929b18c7c0053d264f7e35e3fb48bfadde9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/commits/dab4929b18c7c0053d264f7e35e3fb48bfadde9c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/commits/a57f45f2ad919b5b7c7de77e0db243771bdcd946/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T21:44:51Z","email":"baiyingzhu1110@gmail.com","name":"Cindy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T21:44:51Z","email":"baiyingzhu1110@gmail.com","name":"Cindy"},"message":"feat: Phase 1 + Phase 2 — micro-frontend scaffold with Vercel deployment support\n\nPhase 1: Core micro-frontend architecture\n- Main app shell with wujie sub-app loading (alive mode)\n- Two sub-apps: supplier management + goods management\n- Shared TypeScript types (@wlp/shared)\n- Config center (apps.json, routes.json, environments.json)\n\nPhase 2: Deployment readiness\n- Sub-apps with wujie lifecycle hooks (__WUJIE_MOUNT__/__WUJIE_UNMOUNT__)\n- CORS headers via vercel.json for cross-origin sub-app loading\n- Environment-aware URL resolution (import.meta.env.VITE_* with localhost fallback)\n- Fixed routing inconsistency (removed hash prefix from activeRule/path)\n- Simplified SubAppContainer with useLocation() instead of manual hash parsing\n- GitHub Actions CI + Vercel CLI manual deploy workflow","tree":{"sha":"72816f1695a774e44d2a9d0bfdf3598806a3327f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/git/trees/72816f1695a774e44d2a9d0bfdf3598806a3327f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cindyzhu/webapp-lifecycle-platform/git/commits/a57f45f2ad919b5b7c7de77