able observations as JSON null. Avoid unconditional\nLinux CPU metadata reads and hash Windows native .pyd artifacts.\nDocument nullable observations and qualify historical coverage counts.\n\nNumerical inputs, timing and result checks stay unchanged; no solver\nor polyglot numerical surface changes. Shared-host benchmark evidence\nmakes no isolated latency or speedup claim.\n\nValidation: 104 existing real Linux public/native/CLI tests; strict\ntyping, canonical Ruff, unmasked docstrings and format on all four files.\nIndependent Claude manager review CLEAR qualifies the exact four-file\nobject on 0049a287. Genuine macOS/Windows qualification follows hosted CI.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 01a0f270","tree":{"sha":"0f6191e70efeb2669995373054e7933b195e5008","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/0f6191e70efeb2669995373054e7933b195e5008"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/e8ef5cf18a02f051b8c7a552d26e787c55b15816","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/e8ef5cf18a02f051b8c7a552d26e787c55b15816","node_id":"C_kwDORbf-u9oAKGU4ZWY1Y2YxOGEwMmYwNTFiOGM3YTU1MmQyNmU3ODdjNTViMTU4MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/0049a287eaadf84e87283b849b46990c5be5f16c","sha":"0049a287eaadf84e87283b849b46990c5be5f16c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/0049a287eaadf84e87283b849b46990c5be5f16c"}],"sha":"e8ef5cf18a02f051b8c7a552d26e787c55b15816","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/e8ef5cf18a02f051b8c7a552d26e787c55b15816"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/0049a287eaadf84e87283b849b46990c5be5f16c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:42:26Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:42:26Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"ci(security): audit the Studio frontend lock on every run\n\nOnly the Python locks were audited in CI. A vulnerable package in\nstudio-web/pnpm-lock.yaml showed up as a repository alert and as a failed\nautomated update, with nothing at the head to repeat the check.\n\n- New job studio-web-audit in the Studio frontend workflow runs pnpm audit\n  against the committed lock. It needs no install, applies no severity\n  threshold, no production-only filter and no ignore flag, and a registry\n  error fails it.\n- The job is registered in the CI workflow policy, so ci-gate requires it.\n- A workflow test fixes the command and forbids continue-on-error on it.\n- SECURITY.md describes the audit.\n\nChecked against lock-only copies: the current lock reports no known\nvulnerabilities; the lock of 4a6a9c0b fails on six undici advisories and\nthe lock of 71dec310 fails on adm-zip and undici advisories.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b52b","tree":{"sha":"65439a724bb5636beaf7e938e5026188b7a2218e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/65439a724bb5636beaf7e938e5026188b7a2218e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/0049a287eaadf84e87283b849b46990c5be5f16c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/0049a287eaadf84e87283b849b46990c5be5f16c","node_id":"C_kwDORbf-u9oAKDAwNDlhMjg3ZWFhZGY4NGU4NzI4M2I4NDliNDY5OTBjNWJlNWYxNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/5a35a47bf2e193fbe01ed66a6539f3a96ff8a074","sha":"5a35a47bf2e193fbe01ed66a6539f3a96ff8a074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/5a35a47bf2e193fbe01ed66a6539f3a96ff8a074"}],"sha":"0049a287eaadf84e87283b849b46990c5be5f16c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/0049a287eaadf84e87283b849b46990c5be5f16c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/5a35a47bf2e193fbe01ed66a6539f3a96ff8a074/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:09:24Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:09:24Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(upde): keep the Julia adapter measurable where Julia is absent\n\nThe branch-coverage job runs without juliacall. After b9740d41 the direct\nJulia UPDE adapter measured 78.00 % line and 40.00 % branch coverage there,\nbelow its floors of 81.25 % and 50.00 %.\n\n- The error translation is now one predicate, _is_julia_domain_error. It\n  looks juliacall up among the loaded modules and never imports it, and a\n  loaded module without JuliaError is treated as no runtime, so a partial\n  runtime cannot replace the original failure with an AttributeError.\n- New tests cover the partial-runtime case and the reuse of an already\n  loaded Julia module without a second runtime probe.\n\nMeasured with the adapter''s five test files in an environment without\njuliacall: 82.98 % line (39 of 47) and 60.00 % branch (6 of 10). The eight\nremaining statements need a Julia runtime; the native runtime tests run\nthem, and those tests pass against real Julia with this change. No\nthreshold is changed.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b52b","tree":{"sha":"4753e58acd44a1479714f78eab9949ddbd9ba5fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/4753e58acd44a1479714f78eab9949ddbd9ba5fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/5a35a47bf2e193fbe01ed66a6539f3a96ff8a074","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","followi