/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/088a11cfd65a1fa4eeaee3dd2c97c55c3bc6583b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:35:53Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:35:53Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(security): install only local wheels in the image and update CodeQL\n\nThe builder stage ran \"pip install --no-deps --no-build-isolation\n/wheels/*.whl .\", which the supply-chain scan reports as an unpinned\ninstall (Pinned-Dependencies, Dockerfile). The stage now builds the\nproject wheel with the hash-pinned build tools and installs local wheels\nonly. The same commands were checked in a clean environment: the wheel\ncarries the console scripts, the serve module and the packaged schema.\n\ngithub/codeql-action moves from v4.38.0 to v4.38.2\n(2892aa5e19bbd11bc0cff5427e3b750a04d9e3c2, the peeled v4.38.2 tag) in\nthe CodeQL and Scorecard workflows.\n\nThe performance guide regains its boundary sentence: the 2026-10-01\nfigures are regression context, not portable throughput or real-time\nguarantees. Its test is deselected in CI by name and had failed\nunnoticed since 58707d41.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b52b","tree":{"sha":"c4549a14f66549ebfa0965f9c6a08b84d8369d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/c4549a14f66549ebfa0965f9c6a08b84d8369d8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/088a11cfd65a1fa4eeaee3dd2c97c55c3bc6583b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified