ffer contracts and exact exception types, numerical limits, actual kernel\nabsence and CLI diagnostics.\nRefresh all three methods in both actual environments against an independent\nDOP853 tensor reference; shared-host timings remain local diagnostics. Update\nthe public contracts and generated capability inventory. Six touched Python\nfiles pass strict typing and scoped native/Python/doc/pre-commit checks;\nunreachable producer guards and native generated branches stay visible and\nare recorded in the independent source review.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 01a0f270","tree":{"sha":"ba27dee8634f2ce31eb50b66c08bdaf1b54ccb2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/ba27dee8634f2ce31eb50b66c08bdaf1b54ccb2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/e962aa0112ca3730cbcd273b886a51d585a2db44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-