e writable coupling admission, preserving\naliases and direct native plasticity while returning recoverable borrow errors.\nApply finite torus and timestep checks in both actual runtimes, normalise\ninteger arithmetic, and retain the entry diagnostic after failed batches.\n\nReplace backend substitutes with real public/native equation and recovery\ntests. Document CSR ownership and cached stage diagnostics across Python,\nPyO3 and Rust; no Go, Julia or Mojo sparse counterpart exists in the inventory.\nRefresh both sparse runtime diagnostics with independent CSR references,\nraw repetitions and non-isolated timing limits. Document unreachable guards\nand generated-code coverage gaps without exclusions or weakened gates.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: 01a0f270","tree":{"sha":"42f5493f72e62c86a8001ff1d05f8d76714769cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/42f5493f72e62c86a8001ff1d05f8d76714769cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/e0172953a1a3099c556a256d3a967ef189c08e72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/e0172953a1a3099c556a256d3a967ef189c08e72","node_id":"C_kwDORbf-u9oAKGUwMTcyOTUzYTFhMzA5OWM1NTZhMjU2ZDNhOTY3ZWYxODljMDhlNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/5a2e1aea11516c0f6a77fc1428e084478f780cb6","sha":"5a2e1aea11516c0f6a77fc1428e084478f780cb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/5a2e1aea11516c0f6a77fc1428e084478f780cb6"}],"sha":"e0172953a1a3099c556a256d3a967ef189c08e72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/e0172953a1a3099c556a256d3a967ef189c08e72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/5a2e1aea11516c0f6a77fc1428e084478f780cb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:01:57Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:01:57Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(security): gRPC errors never carry exception text\n\ngrpcio answers an exception that escapes a servicer method with UNKNOWN\nand the detail \"Exception calling application: <exception text>\". Two\npaths reached callers that way. Binary (\"-bin\") request metadata broke\nthe strict UTF-8 decode in the authorisation step, so any\nunauthenticated caller received the interpreter''s decode error. Any\nother unexpected failure in a call body surfaced its text.\n\nUndecodable metadata pairs are now ignored. Every RPC is guarded: an\nunexpected failure is logged server-side and answered with INTERNAL and\nthe fixed detail \"internal error\". Authored request refusals are the\nexplicit GrpcRequestRefusalError (SPOError, ValueError) and still arrive\nverbatim as INVALID_ARGUMENT. Real-server probes cover every RPC, the\nbinary-metadata path with and without a configured key, and a faulting\nengine; server_grpc.py stays at 100 % line and branch coverage.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: b52b","tree":{"sha":"e6b1aa51cee9d3c2526069ea96b121020a3a9520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/e6b1aa51cee9d3c2526069ea96b121020a3a9520"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/5a2e1aea11516c0f6a77fc1428e084478f780cb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6V