um/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/e0ff36b6ba552e7c2c8cded47194846001d8b211/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:27:03Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:27:03Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(supervisor): rate-limit CBF admission against the last admitted value\n\nPolicyCBFChannel is frozen, so its previous_action stayed the rate-limit\nreference for every decision: a zeta ramp within max_rate was held one\nstep above the constructor value for the whole run. The admission gate\nnow tracks the last admitted value per channel and passes it to the\nchannel; the channel''s value is the reference for the first decision.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: ae6d","tree":{"sha":"a5575eb37ce93f660bfabd3beaea240a6798a2ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/a5575eb37ce93f660bfabd3beaea240a6798a2ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/e0ff36b6ba552e7c2c8cded47194846001d8b211","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com