t":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:33:02Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(studio): block an owned-connector record whose spec changed after replay\n\nThe owned live-connector record names the contract hash of the replay''s\nconnector plan, but built the sync envelope from the binding spec on\ndisk. A spec edited after the replay gave an accepted record under the\nreplay''s contract while the adapter ran on the edited one. A spec that\nno longer yields the replay''s contract now blocks the record.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: ae6d","tree":{"sha":"cda1ff99f3cee0995f39fbeea9f950662e3fe2d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/cda1ff99f3cee0995f39fbeea9f950662e3fe2d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/3baa578363093f44b84d5b84938e18fa654a61c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/3baa578363093f44b84d5b84938e18fa654a61c2","node_id":"C_kwDORbf-u9oAKDNiYWE1NzgzNjMwOTNmNDRiODRkNWI4NDkzOGUxOGZhNjU0YTYxYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/b37c9dd4f2eefee6743da9029b38f4b8767ac3ad","sha":"b37c9dd4f2eefee6743da9029b38f4b8767ac3ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/b37c9dd4f2eefee6743da9029b38f4b8767ac3ad"}],"sha":"3baa578363093f44b84d5b84938e18fa654a61c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/3baa578363093f44b84d5b84938e18fa654a61c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/b37c9dd4f2eefee6743da9029b38f4b8767ac3ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:22:43Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:22:43Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(studio): make the deployment commands run against the CLI and image\n\nThe audit and WASM exports listed spo audit summary and spo export wasm,\nwhich do not exist. The docker target began with docker compose config\nwithout a compose file, and docker run passed spo to an image whose\nentrypoint is already the spo CLI, in /app instead of the mount. The\ncompose validator services and healthchecks used python -m on a package\nwithout __main__. Each command is now one that runs, and a test runs\nthem against the real CLI in a workspace holding the exported files.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: ae6d","tree":{"sha":"4730831747996553eba067744a3afde01b5c250d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/4730831747996553eba067744a3afde01b5c250d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/b37c9dd4f2eefee6743da9029b38f4b8767ac3ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/b37c9dd4f2eefee6743da9029b38f4b8767ac3ad","n