ed\" check never fired and the request was\nadmitted whatever the other nodes spent; the preflight CLI accepts the\nNaN JSON literal and issued a bundle for it. Each node''s spend must be a\nfinite non-negative real (booleans and text are refused).\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: ae6d","tree":{"sha":"bd2669335fae0350cfd7c7ee806ebe06b602e5da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/bd2669335fae0350cfd7c7ee806ebe06b602e5da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/f89bef71cfb9873971153d1be423b87d42607593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/f89bef71cfb9873971153d1be423b87d42607593","node_id":"C_kwDORbf-u9oAKGY4OWJlZjcxY2ZiOTg3Mzk3MTE1M2QxYmU0MjNiODdkNDI2MDc1OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/2da0552faa892abbad5ee785843ba99c02353cc4","sha":"2da0552faa892abba