wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/985e6528214765840cfc45b2a1a4c2a6eef933bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:13:32Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:13:32Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(cli): verify the seals of plugin lifecycle and scheduler artefacts\n\nEvery lifecycle, remediation and scheduler review artefact is sealed\nwith payload[field] = _record_hash(payload), but the consuming commands\nonly checked that the field was 64 hex characters, so an edited\nartefact travelled down the chain under its stale hash (a dashboard row\nedited from blocked to completed became a no_op control action). Nine\npayload loaders and seven direct loads now recompute the seal after\ntheir structural checks; overdue flags must be booleans. Hand-built test\nfixtures are sealed with the CLI''s own record hash.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: ae6d","tree":{"sha":"e94d7d3fecbf1085d02bbca9dfcd3044fe0998ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/e94d7d3fecbf1085d02bbca9dfcd3044fe0998ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/985e652821476