red{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/605e0b09dfe566db2653ac04ee08aefae722707d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:49:28Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:49:28Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(cli): refuse assurance evidence rows with coerced fields\n\nstr(row[\"evidence_id\"]) turned null into \"None\" and dict(row[\"record\"])\nreshaped a list of pairs, so malformed evidence entered the assurance\ncase under invented identifiers. Rows now need non-empty string id,\ncategory and summary and an object record; malformed JSON is a clean\nerror.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: ae6d","tree":{"sha":"dfd86b8d608727da10d224e9bf7a60d1ed0cec56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/dfd86b8d608727da10d224e9bf7a60d1ed0cec56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/605e0b09dfe566db2653ac04ee08aefae722707d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/605e0b09dfe566db2653ac04ee08aefae722707d","node_id":"C_kwDORbf-u9oAKDYwNWUwYjA5ZGZlNTY2ZGIyNjUzYWMwNGVlMDhhZWZhZTcyMjcwN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commit/c1eb9d78328460477441975ba6aba1130d98f258","sha":"c1eb9d78328460477441975ba6aba1130d98f258","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/c1eb9d78328460477441975ba6aba1130d98f258"}],"sha":"605e0b09dfe566db2653ac04ee08aefae722707d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/605e0b09dfe566db2653ac04ee08aefae722707d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/commits/c1eb9d78328460477441975ba6aba1130d98f258/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:47:51Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:47:51Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(cli): verify bundle and pack seals in the Grafana pack and playbook\n\nThe dashboard pack and the live deployment playbook checked only that\nbundle_hash and dashboard_pack_hash were hex, so a bundle whose linkage\ncounts were edited to clear the rollout gate produced a \"ready\"\nplaybook. Both commands now recompute the seals; the pack refuses a\nmetric prefix that is not a Prometheus name (it is spliced into PromQL\nqueries) and the playbook refuses boolean counts. The existing success\nfixture now seals with the canonical compact JSON.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: ae6d","tree":{"sha":"a68e0592c77fd2cc51882cfa39e446c5ddaafe24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/a68e0592c77fd2cc51882cfa39e446c5ddaafe24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/c1eb9d78328460477441975ba6aba1130d98f258","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starr