nce@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:42:54Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(cli): bundle only scheduler records whose hash covers their content\n\nThe observability bundle copied the scheduler dashboard and replay\nhashes as linkage and counted their rows without checking them, so an\nedited row under a stale hash was bundled as the sealed record. Both\nhashes are now recomputed with the scheduler''s canonical record hash,\nand a row''s overdue flag must be a boolean (bool(\"false\") is true).\nThe existing bundle test fixture now seals with the same canonical\nJSON the scheduler uses.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)\nSeat: ae6d","tree":{"sha":"7a91a62828aabd8210bbc4a6ebf3c390657045b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/trees/7a91a62828aabd8210bbc4a6ebf3c390657045b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-phase-orchestrator/git/commits/f1f6336d1574017e6b5586685d979e8475d8b0fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulu