/users/naveensingh-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/a1adbaf4170903ea77382c6378a9ca8514e04a8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T04:21:55Z","email":"mac.book02082025@gmail.com","name":"Naveen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T04:21:55Z","email":"mac.book02082025@gmail.com","name":"Naveen"},"message":"feat: comprehensive dashboard redesign, real-time activity audit, and dynamic filtering\n\n- Dashboard: Implemented high-fidelity 70/30 layout with compact KPIs, quality charts, and a dynamic Skills Index sidebar.\n- Activity Audit: Integrated full-lifecycle logging for Units, Skills, and Vault fragments; added dynamic activity grid with rich technical metadata.\n- Filtering: Added global date-range filters (Today -> Year) synchronized across backend services and frontend stores.\n- Fixes: Resolved page-refresh redirection loop via optimistic auth initialization; fixed SignalStore type mismatches.\n- UX: Renamed core navigation (Overview -> Dashboard); preserved original operational stats UI while adding executive KPIs.\n- Backend: Enhanced Stats/Activity services with date-fns integration and rebuild/backfill of legacy logs.","tree":{"sha":"26514055b326eb311d538f2f290eaad363472dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/git/trees/26514055b326eb311d538f2f290eaad363472dae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/git/commits/a1adbaf4170903ea77382c6378a9ca8514e04a8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224239089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/naveensingh-dev","id":224239089,"login":"naveensingh-dev","node_id":"U_kgDODV2d8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveensingh-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commit/a1adbaf4170903ea77382c6378a9ca8514e04a8e","node_id":"C_kwDORbnMAdoAKGExYWRiYWY0MTcwOTAzZWE3NzM4MmM2Mzc4YTljYTg1MTRlMDRhOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commit/b6c25b0aefa087d747ede5db9736d771d67cca65","sha":"b6c25b0aefa087d747ede5db9736d771d67cca65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/b6c25b0aefa087d747ede5db9736d771d67cca65"}],"sha":"a1adbaf4170903ea77382c6378a9ca8514e04a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/a1adbaf4170903ea77382c6378a9ca8514e04a8e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/b6c25b0aefa087d747ede5db9736d771d67cca65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T16:32:01Z","email":"naveensingh@Naveens-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Naveen Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T16:32:01Z","email":"naveensingh@Naveens-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Naveen Singh"},"message":"feat: implement Details View and centralized Confirmation System\n\nThis update enhances UI visibility, refines cognitive UX, and expands AI Knowledge capabilities:\n\n- **AI Engine**: Added upload_document and delete_document routes with KnowledgeService integration.\n- **Multi-View Layouts**: Added ''Details'' view to Overview and Skills modules for deeper system visibility.\n- **Cognitive UX**: Replaced browser confirm prompts with a custom ConfirmDialog and ConfirmStore.\n- **Skills Refactoring**:\n  - Implemented global project filter in SkillsSynthesis.\n  - Enhanced SkillsStore to support cross-unit intelligence retrieval.\n- **Data Layer Expansion**: Updated Prisma schema with Session and Knowledge models.\n- **Style Cleanup**: Streamlined Overview styles and simplified card logic.","tree":{"sha":"8ac5f2fe48dcc52a6515cefdfcee926805ffb479","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/git/trees/8ac5f2fe48dcc52a6515cefdfcee926805ffb479"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/git/commits/b6c25b0aefa087d747ede5db9736d771d67cca65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commit/b6c25b0aefa087d747ede5db9736d771d67cca65","node_id":"C_kwDORbnMAdoAKGI2YzI1YjBhZWZhMDg3ZDc0N2VkZTVkYjk3MzZkNzcxZDY3Y2NhNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commit/848c406026f9f093515a0166f6e8f4fd5ab35213","sha":"848c406026f9f093515a0166f6e8f4fd5ab35213","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/848c406026f9f093515a0166f6e8f4fd5ab35213"}],"sha":"b6c25b0aefa087d747ede5db9736d771d67cca65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/b6c25b0aefa087d747ede5db9736d771d67cca65"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/848c406026f9f093515a0166f6e8f4fd5ab35213/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T14:23:32Z","email":"naveensingh@Naveens-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Naveen Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T14:23:32Z","email":"naveensingh@Naveens-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Naveen Singh"},"message":"feat: switch to Gemini API and enhance core platform intelligence\n\nSummary of changes:\n\n- Integrated Google Gemini (gemini-1.5-flash) into the AI engine, prioritizing it over OpenAI.\n\n- Added Chat and Knowledge backend modules (NestJS) to handle direct communication and RAG retrieval.\n\n- Updated Frontend SignalStore (NgRx) to manage global authentication, project states, and unit analytics.\n\n- Refined Dashboard UI with dynamic load metrics and revamped unit cards.\n\n- Updated Prisma schema for improved data integrity with cascade deletes and analytics fields.\n\n- Cleaned up project configuration and updated dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"6ec573a711571f51406f26275dbb3f85203dcc42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/git/trees/6ec573a711571f51406f26275dbb3f85203dcc42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/git/commits/848c406026f9f093515a0166f6e8f4fd5ab35213","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commit/848c406026f9f093515a0166f6e8f4fd5ab35213","node_id":"C_kwDORbnMAdoAKDg0OGM0MDYwMjZmOWYwOTM1MTVhMDE2NmY2ZThmNGZkNWFiMzUyMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commit/58caf7ccdce3b41e45126a178e4bd9e00f94a43e","sha":"58caf7ccdce3b41e45126a178e4bd9e00f94a43e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/58caf7ccdce3b41e45126a178e4bd9e00f94a43e"}],"sha":"848c406026f9f093515a0166f6e8f4fd5ab35213","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/848c406026f9f093515a0166f6e8f4fd5ab35213"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/58caf7ccdce3b41e45126a17