ely revamped UI/UX aesthetics across dashboard, overview, knowledge, and skills views.\n\n- Implemented advanced dynamic theme management (midnight, slate, forest, void, nebula).\n\n- Updated Prisma schema with ''Activity'' model and added ''description'' to ''Project''.\n\n- Added functional dynamic components for activity tracking and data visualization.","tree":{"sha":"ec7098d5a5e178848f341d9cf05dd206a86c95bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/git/trees/ec7098d5a5e178848f341d9cf05dd206a86c95bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/git/commits/05576cca55b06ee5bbc27d86a9765490b3e22d6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commit/05576cca55b06ee5bbc27d86a9765490b3e22d6a","node_id":"C_kwDORbnMAdoAKDA1NTc2Y2NhNTViMDZlZTViYmMyN2Q4NmE5NzY1NDkwYjNlMjJkNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commit/265215bc738b544a614790a0dac6df89e5fcdba9","sha":"265215bc738b544a614790a0dac6df89e5fcdba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/265215bc738b544a614790a0dac6df89e5fcdba9"}],"sha":"05576cca55b06ee5bbc27d86a9765490b3e22d6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/05576cca55b06ee5bbc27d86a9765490b3e22d6a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/naveensingh-dev/sas-platform/commits/265215bc738b544a614790a0dac6df89e5fcdba9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T09:26:33Z","email":"naveensingh@Naveens-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Naveen Singh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T09:26:33Z","email":"naveensingh@Naveens-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Naveen Singh"},"message":"docs: upgrade README with advanced UI/UX and comprehensive project details","tree":{"sha":"d5ebca8f6b2d5116442db097bd6c6285d44ee04f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos