ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/commits/de1080289581ab4f3ee52caece67416c11609aaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T20:48:06Z","email":"alex.tuppen@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T20:48:06Z","email":"alex.tuppen@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"message":"Redesign WorkStatusCard availability selector\n\nReplaces the unstyled select dropdown with a custom radio button group.\nOptions are disabled by default and activate when the user clicks\n\"Update your availability\", which changes to \"Save your availability\"\nin edit mode. Dispatching to Redux only occurs on save.\n\nAn external status change received via the store sync bridge resets\nthe component to its default read-only state with the incoming value\nselected, preventing stale local edits from persisting.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66e58e40ae011318fbc688040b2561a51fe34bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/git/trees/66e58e40ae011318fbc688040b2561a51fe34bc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/git/commits/de1080289581ab4f3ee52caece67416c11609aaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7440937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alextuppen","id":7440937,"login":"alextuppen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDA5Mzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/commit/de1080289581ab4f3ee52caece67416c11609aaf","node_id":"C_kwDORbtg_doAKGRlMTA4MDI4OTU4MWFiNGYzZWU1MmNhZWNlNjc0MTZjMTE2MDlhYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/commit/de25eb4a0f3e0a394365752d419049ba697edfff","sha":"de25eb4a0f3e0a394365752d419049ba697edfff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/commits/de25eb4a0f3e0a394365752d419049ba697edfff"}],"sha":"de1080289581ab4f3ee52caece67416c11609aaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/commits/de1080289581ab4f3ee52caece67416c11609aaf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7440937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alextuppen","id":7440937,"login":"alextuppen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDA5Mzc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alextuppen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/commits/de25eb4a0f3e0a394365752d419049ba697edfff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T20:00:11Z","email":"alex.tuppen@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T20:00:11Z","email":"alex.tuppen@gmail.com","name":"Alex"},"message":"Implement CustomEvent message bus for cross-store state sync\n\nIntroduces a typed event bus and reusable Redux middleware factory to\nkeep workStatus in sync across the dashboard and navigation micro-frontend\nstores without coupling them directly to each other.\n\n- src/shared/storeBridge.ts: publishStoreAction, subscribeToStoreActions,\n  asSynced helpers. asSynced tags mirrored actions with _storeSync: true\n  to prevent infinite broadcast loops.\n- src/shared/syncMiddleware.ts: createSyncMiddleware factory. Intercepts\n  nominated action types and broadcasts them as store:sync CustomEvents,\n  skipping actions already marked as synced.\n- dashboard/store and navigation/store: each wired up with syncMiddleware\n  for their respective updateWorkStatus action type.\n- dashboard-entry and navigation-entry: each subscribe to store:sync\n  events from the other app and dispatch mirrored actions locally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a63318ef9cfe18b1fd7ded7a8152d25e73cd14d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/git/trees/a63318ef9cfe18b1fd7ded7a8152d25e73cd14d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alextuppen/candidate-test-fe7c6fcc/git/commits/de25eb4a0f3e0a394365752d419049ba697edfff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7440937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/