/commits/4ba3aa272496a8534c94b29e9803f2882cd2368c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T16:41:13Z","email":"aman.khairkar555@gmail.com","name":"Aman Khairkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T16:41:13Z","email":"aman.khairkar555@gmail.com","name":"Aman Khairkar"},"message":"fix(audit): v1.6.2 — resolve 20 audit issues across all modules\n\nCritical fixes:\n- XIRR now includes sip_config cashflows (was silently excluding all SIPs)\n- Peer Lag alert (Rule D) fixed to use MFDB.getFund + MFDB.getPeers instead of allMfFunds\n- Advisor engine-worker.js: replaced 100% mocked results with real CAGR, volatility, Sharpe, max drawdown & HOLD/MONITOR/SWITCH recommendation\n\nHigh severity:\n- Peer DB cache wired: MFDB.setPeers/getPeers now active in fetchCategoryPeers (24h TTL)\n- Large & Mid Cap mis-classified as Large Cap — corrected in category mapping\n- SIP rows showing NaN units — fixed date/units resolution for sip_config entries\n- getCagrForYears guard: 252 trading days → 365 calendar days\n- package.json: added serve devDependency, bumped to v1.6.2\n- advisor app.js: fetches real MFDB peers instead of hardcoded mock entries\n\nMedium severity:\n- 80ms artificial delay per peer fetch removed from getPeerRanking\n- Dead code removed: empty try/catch block, fetchTERFromGithub stub, stale V1 schema constants in advisor-db.js, runDailySync alias\n- XSS: peer.schemeName now escaped with escapeHtml() in ui.js\n- calcXIRR removed from utils.js (duplicate of computeXIRR, also missing -0.999 clamp guard)\n\nLow severity:\n- dev-diagnostics.js gated to localhost only\n- Speculative reverse category mapping removed\n\nDevOps:\n- node_modules untracked from git (git rm -r --cached node_modules/)\n- Project Full Audit.md updated with comprehensive deep-dive findings","tree":{"sha":"f051783b6b55f9b01810e7d3e426a73c6a26385f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmanK27/MutualFund-Research-App/git/trees/f051783b6b55f9b01810e7d3e426a73c6a26385f"},"url":"http