tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizansayyed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizansayyed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizansayyed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizansayyed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizansayyed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faizansayyed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizansayyed/expenseiq/commits/0c6c96f3ade082d289a94fb9576e6b9f85da831c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T21:08:17Z","email":"faizansayyed36@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Sayyed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T21:08:17Z","email":"faizansayyed36@gmail.com","name":"Faizan Sayyed"},"message":"feat(auth-service): implement authentication service with JWT, refresh tokens, and security setup\n\n* Add new `auth-service` Spring Boot module with standalone PostgreSQL support\n* Implement user registration, login, logout, and token refresh APIs\n* Add JWT authentication using RS256 asymmetric keys\n* Support access + refresh token generation with rotation and Redis storage\n* Add BCrypt password hashing and role-based authentication\n* Create `AuthUser` entity, repository, DTOs, and role enum\n* Configure Spring Security with stateless sessions and JWT filter\n* Add Flyway migration for auth tables and indexes\n* Implement global exception handling with standardized API responses\n* Add Swagger/OpenAPI docs and health actuator endpoints\n* Add Dockerfile for containerized deployment\n* Include unit tests and integration tests for full auth flow","tree":{"sha":"93292e6619dab5f54530216dee5f1d6922fee54b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizansayyed/expenseiq/git/trees/93292e6619dab5f54530216dee5f1d6922fee54b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/faizansayyed/expenseiq/git/commits/0c6c96f3ade082d289a94fb9576e6b9f85da831c","verification":