ttps://github.com/JoasASantos","id":34966120,"login":"JoasASantos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY2MTIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commits/6f6ac30487eb591815f16c8d59c26f9b35a3214d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T19:59:54Z","email":"joasantonio108@gmail.com","name":"CyberSecurityUP"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T19:59:54Z","email":"joasantonio108@gmail.com","name":"CyberSecurityUP"},"message":"feat: Add game dev plugins, context keeper, and improved installer v2.0\n\nGame Development Plugins (5):\n- gamedev-unity: C#, MonoBehaviour, ScriptableObjects, ECS/DOTS, URP/HDRP,\n  Input System, networking, editor extensions, object pooling\n- gamedev-unreal: C++, UObject/UCLASS, GAS (Gameplay Ability System),\n  Enhanced Input, Nanite/Lumen, behavior trees, replication, Niagara\n- gamedev-threejs: Browser games, ECS architecture, Rapier.js physics,\n  React Three Fiber, custom shaders, input manager, audio, R3F game pattern\n- gamedev-godot: GDScript 4, node system, state machines, CharacterBody,\n  Resources, autoloads, GDExtension, C# integration, multiplayer\n- gamedev-design: Core loops, balancing (DPS/EHP/TTK), economy systems,\n  ECS/event/command patterns, level design, camera design, GDD/TDD templates\n\nContext Keeper Plugin:\n- Persistent context across Claude Code sessions\n- Auto-saves architecture, conventions, decisions, active work\n- Commands: save, restore, status, snapshot, resume, decide, issue, clean\n- Smart detection of context-worthy information\n- MEMORY.md index with detailed topic files\n\nInstaller v2.0:\n- Category-based installation (./install.sh -c gamedev)\n- Interactive mode (./install.sh -i) with numbered category picker\n- Status command (./install.sh -s) shows installed vs available\n- Update command (./install.sh --update) refreshes installed plugins\n- Bash 3.2 compatible (works on macOS default shell)\n- Improved help with examples and prerequisites\n- Category display with tree-style layout\n\nTotal: 48 plugins, 55 slash commands across 8 categories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"854e0683d30e2c617352e2e4f9b26ac3fc9a1b8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/git/trees/854e0683d30e2c617352e2e4f9b26ac3fc9a1b8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/git/commits/6f6ac30487eb591815f16c8d59c26f9b35a3214d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34966120?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoasASantos","id":34966120,"login":"JoasASantos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY2MTIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commit/6f6ac30487eb591815f16c8d59c26f9b35a3214d","node_id":"C_kwDORcIkmNoAKDZmNmFjMzA0ODdlYjU5MTgxNWYxNmM4ZDU5YzI2ZjliMzVhMzIxNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commit/bd3006d7564be6f2b0d65462c7c1ef048aa95fa4","sha":"bd3006d7564be6f2b0d65462c7c1ef048aa95fa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commits/bd3006d7564be6f2b0d65462c7c1ef048aa95fa4"}],"sha":"6f6ac30487eb591815f16c8d59c26f9b35a3214d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commits/6f6ac30487eb591815f16c8d59c26f9b35a3214d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34966120?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoasASantos","id":34966120,"login":"JoasASantos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY2MTIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commits/bd3006d7564be6f2b0d65462c7c1ef048aa95fa4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T03:26:01Z","email":"joasantonio108@gmail.com","name":"CyberSecurityUP"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T03:26:01Z","email":"joasantonio108@gmail.com","name":"CyberSecurityUP"},"message":"feat: Add 30 new plugins — blue team, pentest, RE, frontend, security\n\nBlue Team & Defense (8 plugins):\n- blue-team-soc: SOC operations, alert triage, Tier 1-3 analysis\n- blue-team-dfir: Digital forensics, incident response, NIST SP 800-61\n- blue-team-malware-analysis: Static/dynamic analysis, YARA rules\n- blue-team-siem: Sigma, Splunk SPL, Elastic KQL, Sentinel detection rules\n- blue-team-threat-intel: CTI lifecycle, OSINT, actor profiling, STIX/TAXII\n- blue-team-hardening: CIS Benchmarks, STIGs, Windows/Linux/container\n- blue-team-network-defense: IDS/IPS, Suricata/Zeek, firewall, DNS security\n- blue-team-edr: EDR/XDR, Sysmon config, endpoint threat hunting\n\nPentest & Offensive (7 plugins):\n- pentest-network: Infrastructure testing, service enumeration\n- pentest-mobile: Android/iOS, Frida, OWASP MASTG/MASVS\n- pentest-cloud: AWS/Azure/GCP, IAM exploitation\n- pentest-wireless: Wi-Fi/Bluetooth/BLE/IoT radio\n- pentest-ad: Active Directory, Kerberos, ADCS, BloodHound\n- pentest-social: Social engineering campaigns, phishing, OSINT\n- pentest-report: Professional report writing, CVSS scoring\n\nReverse Engineering (5 plugins):\n- reverse-binary: PE/ELF/Mach-O, Ghidra/IDA, Go/Rust binaries\n- reverse-malware: Unpacking, C2 RE, config extraction\n- reverse-protocol: Protocol RE, Wireshark dissectors\n- reverse-firmware: IoT/embedded, UART/JTAG, emulation\n- reverse-obfuscation: Deobfuscation, anti-debug/VM bypass\n\nSecurity Architecture (5 plugins):\n- crypto-analysis: RSA/ECC attacks, TLS, key management\n- vuln-research: Fuzzing, CodeQL, responsible disclosure\n- supply-chain-sec: SBOM, SLSA, dependency attacks\n- cloud-security: Cloud architecture, landing zones, IAM\n- devsecops: CI/CD security pipeline, SAST/DAST/SCA\n\nFrontend Advanced (5 plugins):\n- frontend-animations: GSAP, Framer Motion, CSS, spring physics\n- frontend-dom: Web Components, Shadow DOM, browser APIs\n- frontend-3d: Three.js, R3F, WebGL, GLSL shaders\n- frontend-perf: Core Web Vitals, bundle optimization\n- frontend-micro: Module Federation, state machines, monorepo\n\nTotal: 42 plugins with 49 slash commands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04de09f63edc2a17b51a49edc7538f944d4ee39e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/git/trees/04de09f63edc2a17b51a49edc7538f944d4ee39e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/git/commits/bd3006d7564be6f2b0d65462c7c1ef048aa95fa4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34966120?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoasASantos","id":34966120,"login":"JoasASantos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY2MTIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commit/bd3006d7564be6f2b0d65462c7c1ef048aa95fa4","node_id":"C_kwDORcIkmNoAKGJkMzAwNmQ3NTY0YmU2ZjJiMGQ2NTQ2MmM3YzFlZjA0OGFhOTVmYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commit/11e4700232a9d1728ae0a0a4103a32235d25e6b7","sha":"11e4700232a9d1728ae0a0a4103a32235d25e6b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commits/11e4700232a9d1728ae0a0a4103a32235d25e6b7"}],"sha":"bd3006d7564be6f2b0d65462c7c1ef048aa95fa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commits/bd3006d7564be6f2b0d65462c7c1ef048aa95fa4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34966120?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoasASantos","id":34966120,"login":"JoasASantos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY2MTIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/commits/11e4700232a9d1728ae0a0a4103a32235d25e6b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T03:04:22Z","email":"joasantonio108@gmail.com","name":"CyberSecurityUP"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T03:04:22Z","email":"joasantonio108@gmail.com","name":"CyberSecurityUP"},"message":"feat: Add 12 advanced Claude Code plugins with 19 slash commands\n\nComprehensive plugin collection for Claude Code covering:\n- Backend Architect: API design, DB optimization, system architecture\n- Frontend Forge: Component generation, accessibility, design systems\n- Memory Vault: Persistent cross-session knowledge management\n- Red Team Ops: Adversary simulation, attack chains, MITRE ATT&CK\n- Pentest Toolkit: PTES methodology, OWASP Top 10 web testing\n- Exploit Dev: Binary exploitation, CTF solving, reverse engineering\n- API Security: OWASP API Security Top 10, GraphQL/gRPC testing\n- Secure Code Review: SAST-style review with CWE mapping\n- Threat Modeler: STRIDE, DREAD, PASTA frameworks\n- OS Internals: Linux/Windows/macOS kernel and system debugging\n- Context Manager: Context window optimization and preservation\n- Hallucination Guard: Accuracy verification and confidence signaling\n\nIncludes install.sh with selective installation, --list, --force,\nand --uninstall options. Simple one-command setup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93251ce3e30bdbd47941e6fd3741cdf58a410e46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/git/trees/93251ce3e30bdbd47941e6fd3741cdf58a410e46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoasASantos/ClaudeAdvancedPlugins/git/commits/11e4700232a9d1728ae0a0a4103a32235d25e6b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34966120?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoasASantos","id":34966120,"login":"JoasASantos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY2MTIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoasASantos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"