ude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/480973916c7259c09e91cf8601e88eca4fdce266/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:09:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:10:53Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(skills): read SKILL.md as the canonical skill body (core ADR-0084)\n\ncore renamed every .claude/skills/<name>/<name>.md → SKILL.md to make skills\nSkill-tool-callable (core ADR-0084 / PR #132). core-reader''s parser hardcoded\nthe legacy <name>.md filename in four places, so its skill browser would go\nempty after that rename.\n\nResolve the skill body as SKILL.md, falling back to <name>.md for any unmigrated\nskill — both the local-filesystem and GitHub-tree paths. The GitHub regex now\nmatches either filename and dedupes per directory, preferring SKILL.md (so /vault,\nwhich keeps both vault.md and a thin SKILL.md, is listed once).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48b11400dd82190a05754b51d276176fbcc87ae1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/trees/48b11400dd82190a05754b51d276176fbcc87ae1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/commits/480973916c7259c09e91cf8601e88eca4fdce266","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1514