pe":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/461df77946b99d9824b36685e1f8080fa62f19cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-30T03:21:53Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-30T03:21:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: add root-level README (#15)\n\n* feat: complete shared UI migration — add BadgeButton + ErrorBoundary\n\nAll 7 @ojfbot/frame-ui-components now imported: DashboardLayout, ChatShell,\nChatMessage, ThreadSidebar, MarkdownMessage, BadgeButton, ErrorBoundary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add optimizeDeps exclude for frame-ui-components source dep\n\nVite''s import-analysis plugin cannot resolve .ts/.tsx files from\nfile:-linked packages without excluding them from pre-bundling.\nAlso allow serving files from the sibling frame-ui-components repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: remove unused BadgeButton import from CondensedChat\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add optimizeDeps.include for CJS transitive deps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(ci): add CI workflow for build verification\n\nCore-reader had no CI — only a deploy.yml. Added ci.yml with build\nstep matching other Frame OS repos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): remove branch restrictions so all workflows run on PRs\n\nDeploy: push to main = production, pull_request (any branch) = preview.\nCI/security: on [push, pull_request] for all branches.\nFixes PR preview comments and security scans not running on feature PRs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): add security scan + ensure deploy preview runs on all PRs\n\nCreate security-scan.yml (TruffleHog + API key scan + dependency audit).\nChange deploy.yml trigger to on: [push, pull_request] and add PR-number\nlookup to comment step.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: add root-level README for portfolio presentation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc13ba9715d8bb6f6804aa8dcb49b4e03275494e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/trees/dc13ba9715d8bb6f6804aa8dcb49b4e03275494e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/commits/461df77946b99d9824b36685e1f8080fa62f19cb","verification":{"payload":"tree dc13ba9715d8bb6f6804aa8dcb49b4e03275494e\nparent c20b0067cd62d8b9dc7de5910b41b0f7ef45b35a\nauthor ojfbot <151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com> 1774840913 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774840913 -0500\n\ndocs: add root-level README (#15)\n\n* feat: complete shared UI migration — add BadgeButton + ErrorBoundary\n\nAll 7 @ojfbot/frame-ui-components now imported: DashboardLayout, ChatShell,\nChatMessage, ThreadSidebar, MarkdownMessage, BadgeButton, ErrorBoundary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add optimizeDeps exclude for frame-ui-components source dep\n\nVite''s import-analysis plugin cannot resolve .ts/.tsx files from\nfile:-linked packages without excluding them from pre-bundling.\nAlso allow serving files from the sibling frame-ui-components repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: remove unused BadgeButton import from CondensedChat\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add optimizeDeps.include for CJS transitive deps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(ci): add CI workflow for build verification\n\nCore-reader had no CI — only a deploy.yml. Added ci.yml with build\nstep matching other Frame OS repos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): remove branch restrictions so all workflows run on PRs\n\nDeploy: push to main = production, pull_request (any branch) = preview.\nCI/security: on [push, pull_request] for all branches.\nFixes PR preview comments and security scans not running on feature PRs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): add security scan + ensure deploy preview runs on all PRs\n\nCreate security-scan.yml (TruffleHog + API key scan + dependency audit).\nChange deploy.yml trigger to on: [push, pull_request] and add PR-number\nlookup to comment step.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: add root-level README for portfolio presentation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpyexRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMQ8QAEkARbLFpDtZ9hqrX51r6C3Q\nUlyhKVLIWMGPbxtvDmaLRxS+ktY8FujLNOztrqk/x3HIAoJSAfUm9Hdxycpctdvv\npchBPtu/VbZDZorMR4HGMO1uRNyJSLEzRI7QCPrpvvaRAou5KhbYfFxg7EsvCJCP\nVPtf1aRSmQENhvrf3iNSEVwK7G49xJ2Vvw4klNP6ym69ZD7bF9YrGX8mv1IKNesx\ns7XZUG2w0DtBT3+Jnxslttqiiet/uni2WMDid/6baMx/4CFeRCa1bcgmBAlUZy43\n1Mz5U1fwpo7ztT5q3DCidJbMW4iGsOvJJEign/TEe2UTfIxjj/CZ6nkDom0Xv6n5\nqVRXpVfUXOSpud5L0PMaVirQ4Z7rnZoiivsi9wL9eqQ4+SLwB/LRBcwVxF9ltbLU\nbrdXcoqin/zRgJTwwtXRJl6hkoULLe7yM4y06i+xE83nP/I/iCfGfKt8b/O2g3KY\nnNyiTZO7c8mSjgRz6y7/BeU/22+2NMdXiMv82CX+22Pa1lo7p3IMceIOUKCIF7tv\n7s2dv0iZuZdUxdmgkBpbIMYlcoU1ftA0xVRntkkOtFAuAXRe6Q3y9kN81ZFs7IJi\nLLBdGIJEN4irqXtOdb8ESoCWMJfd4HM2c8kK4EDh0dYm5M+bZNhombsc3uMr8/u9\nozDzxr1l12XxwlNyQ6EL\n=QsUo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-30T03:21:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https:/