mmitter":{"date":"2026-03-18T02:18:49Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(corereader): dashboard phases 2-5 — OKRs, Docs, Changes, Activity tabs\n\nPhase 2 — Read-only content tabs:\n- OKRs tab: parses decisions/okr/*.md, expandable objective cards with KR status\n  tags (done/green, in-progress/blue, not-started/gray), linked ADR cross-links\n- Docs tab: parses docs/*.md with lazy content loading, expandable markdown cards\n\nPhase 3C — Git mutations (writable path):\n- GET/PUT /api/git/file — read + write files within CORE_REPO_PATH (path traversal guard)\n- GET /api/git/status — staged/unstaged/untracked via git status --porcelain\n- POST /api/git/stage, /api/git/unstage — git add / restore --staged\n- POST /api/git/commit — git commit -m\n- Changes tab (6th): sidebar with file groups + inline textarea editor + commit panel\n\nActivity tab (A7 scope) — live event feed:\n- GET /api/events — reads ~/.beads/events/YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl, filterable by type/app/date\n- GET /api/events/dates — available log dates\n- Activity tab (7th): timeline feed, 6 lens filters (All/Beads/Agents/Hooks/Molecules/Convoys),\n  color-coded type badges, relative timestamps, 10s auto-refresh\n\nNavigation: ActiveTab extended to 7 values; Dashboard TABS array updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48f8376c6082c6fe70b7a035186ffd43837f005c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/trees/48f8376c6082c6fe70b7a035186ffd43837f005c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/commits/d186ea7881b5cfd458759d1cae287a366234893a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.gith