","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/1d3d5174f0dee39d288aa260a69e5f8720d98e33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T06:43:43Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T06:43:43Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(chat+threads): align CoreReader UI with BlogEngine reference pattern\n\nFull structural parity with other client apps:\n\nCondensedChat (BlogEngine pattern):\n- Full chat UI: collapsible header, message history with MarkdownMessage,\n  TextInput (collapsed) / TextArea (expanded), send + mic buttons\n- chatSlice with CoreReader welcome message + 3 mock suggestion badges\n- Sidebar-aware positioning via sidebarExpanded prop\n\nThreadSidebar (BlogEngine pattern):\n- position:fixed right panel with threadsSlice mock data (3 conversations)\n- Create / delete threads (in-memory), active thread highlight\n- inert=\"\" a11y pattern when collapsed, mobile overlay, delete confirm Modal\n- Uses BlogEngine CSS (visibility + transform transitions, z-index: 9998)\n\nSupporting:\n- BadgeButton + MarkdownMessage copied from BlogEngine (react-markdown/remark-gfm already in deps)\n- carbon.scss: add text-area, tile, modal, skeleton-styles component imports\n- Dashboard: ThreadSidebar uses isExpanded/onToggle; CondensedChat receives sidebarExpanded\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0b264dd22351fc9217d0f2c902985251a988a9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/trees/b0b264dd22351fc9217d0f2c902985251a988a9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/commits/1d3d5174f0dee39d288aa260a69e5f8720d98e33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core-reader/commit/1d3d5174f0dee39d288aa260a69e5f8720d98e33","node_id":"C_kwDORcLpltoAKDFkM2Q1MTc0ZjBkZWUzOWQyODhhYTI2MGE2OWU1Zjg3MjBkOThlMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core-reader/commit/41ba7a783873d3ee4af507a1b1ee8e9b5821f1a0","sha":"41ba7a783873d3ee4af507a1b1ee8e9b5821f1a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/41ba7a783873d3ee4af507a1b1ee8e9b5821f1a0"}],"sha":"1d3d5174f0dee39d288aa260a69e5f8720d98e33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/1d3d5174f0dee39d288aa260a69e5f8720d98e33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/41ba7a783873d3ee4af507a1b1ee8e9b5821f1a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T06:34:09Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T06:34:09Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(dashboard): align structure with cv-builder — no Theme, correct element order\n\nStructure now identical to cv-builder''s reference pattern:\n  <>\n    <ThreadSidebar />      position:fixed overlay, rendered before wrapper\n    <div.dashboard-wrapper>  title suppressed in shellMode, tabs\n    <CondensedChat />      outside wrapper (disabled Phase 1, wired Phase 4)\n  </>\n\n- Remove <Theme> from Dashboard — App.tsx owns standalone theme (g100);\n  shell provides its own Theme context for MF use. The old conditional\n  Theme was double-wrapping in standalone and overriding the shell theme.\n- Remove chat-visible padding rule — only needed when CondensedChat was\n  inside the wrapper; now outside, no wrapper padding required.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f406b680521bdd59a724c7e999993cbb4ddb79a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/trees/1f406b680521bdd59a724c7e999993cbb4ddb79a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/commits/41ba7a783873d3ee4af507a1b1ee8e9b5821f1a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core-reader/commit/41ba7a783873d3ee4af507a1b1ee8e9b5821f1a0","node_id":"C_kwDORcLpltoAKDQxYmE3YTc4Mzg3M2QzZWU0YWY1MDdhMWIxZWU4ZTliNTgyMWYxYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core-reader/commit/3475d27d4e1bb32e21ccb1ee032ec44fa8d936c2","sha":"3475d27d4e1bb32e21ccb1ee032ec44fa8d936c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/3475d27d4e1bb32e21ccb1ee032ec44fa8d936c2"}],"sha":"41ba7a783873d3ee4af507a1b1ee8e9b5821f1a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/41ba7a783873d3ee4af507a1b1ee8e9b5821f1a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/3475d27d4e1bb32e21ccb1ee032ec44fa8d936c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T05:27:18Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T05:27:18Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(theme): inherit shell theme when shellMode; add noEmit to tsconfig\n\n- Dashboard: remove hardcoded <Theme theme=\"white\"> in shell context.\n  In shellMode=true, CSS custom properties cascade from the shell''s own\n  .cds--white / .cds--g100 ancestor — a second <Theme> wrapper overrides\n  the shell''s active theme. Standalone mode keeps the White wrapper.\n- Remove unused imports: setSelectedADR (ADRCard), PHASES (CommandsTab)\n- tsconfig: add noEmit:true — tsc is type-check only; Vite handles emit.\n  Prevents stray .js files being written into src/ on every build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffed6d8e3a27faa9ddf6a6c2e82ff0f9de3b7786","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/trees/ffed6d8e3a27faa9ddf6a6c2e82ff0f9de3b7786"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/git/commits/3475d27d4e1bb32e21ccb1ee032ec44fa8d936c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core-reader/commit/3475d27d4e1bb32e21ccb1ee032ec44fa8d936c2","node_id":"C_kwDORcLpltoAKDM0NzVkMjdkNGUxYmIzMmUyMWNjYjFlZTAzMmVjNDRmYThkOTM2YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/core-reader/commit/7f63a9bd1b73a753bf2cdfe0503ff4000c39ec85","sha":"7f63a9bd1b73a753bf2cdfe0503ff4000c39ec85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/7f63a9bd1b73a753bf2cdfe0503ff4000c39ec85"}],"sha":"3475d27d4e1bb32e21ccb1ee032ec44fa8d936c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/3475d27d4e1bb32e21ccb1ee032ec44fa8d936c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/core-reader/commits/7f63a9bd1b73a753bf2cdfe0503ff4000c39ec85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T05:17:53Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T05:17:53Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(styles): emit .cds--white theme tokens + add ThreadSidebar\n\nThree fixes for the ''white on black'' styles issue:\n\n1. carbon.scss: add @use \"zone\" — this is the module that emits\n   .cds--white { --cds-background: #fff; ... } class selectors.\n   Without it, <Theme> adds the class but no CSS exists for it.\n2. carbon.scss: add config($prefix: cds) + layer + type as per\n   shell''s proven pattern.\n3. Dashboard.tsx: wrap DashboardContent in <Theme theme=\"white\">\n   so the .cds--white class activates the scoped CSS variables.\n\nAlso adds ThreadSidebar (context panel):\n- Right-side fixed panel, 320px wide, opens via Switcher toggle\n- Phase 1 placeholder; will evolve beyond chat threads\n- Follows inert/transform positioning pattern from shell-mf-