.com/arinjaysalgia","id":15005613,"login":"arinjaysalgia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDA1NjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arinjaysalgia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arinjaysalgia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arinjaysalgia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arinjaysalgia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arinjaysalgia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arinjaysalgia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arinjaysalgia/Dietary_Tracking/commits/1bef66d478ef9f2675f1b30e685f3955a3256d29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T09:27:23Z","email":"arinjaysalgia2006@gmail.com","name":"arinjaysalgia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T09:27:23Z","email":"arinjaysalgia2006@gmail.com","name":"arinjaysalgia"},"message":"fix: replace build-time rewrite with runtime API route proxy\n\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL and next.config.js rewrites are evaluated at build\ntime so BACKEND_URL was never available inside the container, causing\nall /api/* calls to hit localhost:8080 (nothing) and return HTTP 500.\n\n- Add app/api/[...path]/route.ts: a Next.js Route Handler that proxies\n  all /api/* requests to BACKEND_URL at request time (runtime env var)\n- Remove NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL; switch frontend fetch calls to relative /api/...\n- Set BACKEND_URL=http://backend:8080 in docker-compose so the proxy\n  reaches the backend over the internal Docker network\n- Remove hardcoded host ports from docker-compose.yml base file to\n  prevent port-list merge conflicts with overlay files\n- Add docker-compose.prod.yml overlay for fixed-port production deploys\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"639125956f30d98010be7d79006177855bfb8d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arinjaysalgia/Dietary_Tracking/git/trees/639125956f30d98010