ith [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"997aca8a87a9e2e96b0e0bcec50a8398d5c4b761","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/git/trees/997aca8a87a9e2e96b0e0bcec50a8398d5c4b761"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/git/commits/b38475c2d8d7b53255a36c777a9509adbf237ca7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commit/b38475c2d8d7b53255a36c777a9509adbf237ca7","node_id":"C_kwDORccTaNoAKGIzODQ3NWMyZDhkN2I1MzI1NWEzNmM3NzdhOTUwOWFkYmYyMzdjYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commit/23a014a9f932b5f03fd585f03fbede2d885389ae","sha":"23a014a9f932b5f03fd585f03fbede2d885389ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/23a014a9f932b5f03fd585f03fbede2d885389ae"}],"sha":"b38475c2d8d7b53255a36c777a9509adbf237ca7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/b38475c2d8d7b53255a36c777a9509adbf237ca7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/23a014a9f932b5f03fd585f03fbede2d885389ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T12:20:12Z","email":"michael@michael.local","name":"michael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T12:20:12Z","email":"michael@michael.local","name":"michael"},"message":"docs: 调整项目阶段，跳过阶段五/六/七，直接进入部署阶段\n\n- 阶段五剩余8个任务标记为跳过（已完成核心通信功能）\n- 阶段六（样式与主题）整体跳过\n- 阶段七（性能优化）整体跳过\n- 阶段八（部署与上线）标记为进行中\n- 更新项目进度跟踪文档和README\n- 当前进度保持60%（75/126任务）\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4212e1f73cb535e7bd25adcb02df9c28e9237f3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/git/trees/4212e1f73cb535e7bd25adcb02df9c28e9237f3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/git/commits/23a014a9f932b5f03fd585f03fbede2d885389ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commit/23a014a9f932b5f03fd585f03fbede2d885389ae","node_id":"C_kwDORccTaNoAKDIzYTAxNGE5ZjkzMmI1ZjAzZmQ1ODVmMDNmYmVkZTJkODg1Mzg5YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commit/ffecd4db7efd07f205d7b197852e4aaf85399482","sha":"ffecd4db7efd07f205d7b197852e4aaf85399482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/ffecd4db7efd07f205d7b197852e4aaf85399482"}],"sha":"23a014a9f932b5f03fd585f03fbede2d885389ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/23a014a9f932b5f03fd585f03fbede2d885389ae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/ffecd4db7efd07f205d7b197852e4aaf85399482/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T12:09:32Z","email":"michael@michael.local","name":"michael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T12:09:32Z","email":"michael@michael.local","name":"michael"},"message":"feat: 完成阶段五核心通信功能（4/12任务，33%）\n\n本次更新完成以下功能：\n\n✨ 新功能\n- T-087/T-088: 实现子应用退出登录流程\n  - 所有子应用（app-user, app-order, app-product）添加退出登录按钮\n  - 主应用监听 LOGOUT action 并执行退出登录逻辑\n  - 支持任意子应用触发登出，所有状态自动同步清空\n\n- T-089: 实现跨应用跳转功能\n  - 订单详情页新增\"查看用户详情\"功能\n  - 实现 app-order → app-user 跨应用导航\n  - 订单类型新增 userId 字段支持关联跳转\n\n- T-092: 实现全局主题切换功能\n  - 顶部导航栏添加主题切换按钮（🌙 亮色 / ☀️ 暗色）\n  - 定义完整的亮色和暗色主题 CSS 变量系统\n  - 主题状态通过 qiankun 全局状态管理同步\n  - 支持实时切换 light / dark 模式\n\n📊 进度更新\n- 阶段五（通信与状态）: 2/12 (17%) → 4/12 (33%)\n- 整体项目进度: 71/126 (56%) → 75/126 (60%)\n\n📝 文档更新\n- 更新项目进度跟踪文档\n- 添加阶段五详细任务列表\n- 更新重大更新记录\n\n🔧 技术实现\n- 主应用监听全局状态变化处理 LOGOUT action\n- 使用 window.location.href 实现跨应用导航\n- CSS 变量 + data-theme 属性实现主题切换\n- 所有子应用（React×2, Vue 3×1）统一通信机制\n\n🎉 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"adfaba81bbcf76fe7c5286250af50139bdbfc1b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/git/trees/adfaba81bbcf76fe7c5286250af50139bdbfc1b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/git/commits/ffecd4db7efd07f205d7b197852e4aaf85399482","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commit/ffecd4db7efd07f205d7b197852e4aaf85399482","node_id":"C_kwDORccTaNoAKGZmZWNkNGRiN2VmZDA3ZjIwNWQ3YjE5Nzg1MmU0YWFmODUzOTk0ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commit/6a78a90aadc7c97c3ef00958e77dc487dafc7420","sha":"6a78a90aadc7c97c3ef00958e77dc487dafc7420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/6a78a90aadc7c97c3ef00958e77dc487dafc7420"}],"sha":"ffecd4db7efd07f205d7b197852e4aaf85399482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/ffecd4db7efd07f205d7b197852e4aaf85399482"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/6a78a90aadc7c97c3ef00958e77dc487dafc7420/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T13:07:44Z","email":"michael@michael.local","name":"michael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T13:07:44Z","email":"michael@michael.local","name":"michael"},"message":"fix: 修复 app-product 和 app-order 的类型导入和编译错误\n\n本次提交修复了三个关键 BUG，确保所有子应用正常运行：\n\n## BUG-009: app-product 类型导入错误\n- 问题：Vite 无法解析 qiankun 和 Vue 的类型导出\n- 解决：InjectionKey、MicroAppStateActions、QiankunProps 使用 import type 语法\n- 文件：packages/app-product/src/qiankun.ts, packages/app-product/src/index.ts\n\n## BUG-010: app-product 响应式错误\n- 问题：useUserInfo 和 useGlobalState 返回普通值导致 .value 访问失败\n- 解决：使用 computed() 包装返回值，确保返回响应式 ref\n- 文件：packages/app-product/src/qiankun.ts\n\n## BUG-011: app-order Babel 编译错误\n- 问题：index.ts 文件包含 JSX 代码但使用 .ts 扩展名\n- 解决：重命名为 index.tsx 并更新 webpack.config.js 入口配置\n- 文件：packages/app-order/src/index.tsx, packages/app-order/webpack.config.js\n\n## 其他更新\n- 创建各子应用的 qiankun 工具文件（qiankun.tsx/qiankun.ts）\n- 更新项目进度跟踪文档\n- 创建 BUG 修复日志和开发日志\n\n所有子应用（app-user、app-product、app-order、app-dashboard）现已完全正常运行。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"add0220334aab6a6b8ce13a3b39304bbe00dd641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/git/trees/add0220334aab6a6b8ce13a3b39304bbe00dd641"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/git/commits/6a78a90aadc7c97c3ef00958e77dc487dafc7420","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commit/6a78a90aadc7c97c3ef00958e77dc487dafc7420","node_id":"C_kwDORccTaNoAKDZhNzhhOTBhYWRjN2M5N2MzZWYwMDk1OGU3N2RjNDg3ZGFmYzc0MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commit/c36d14a0897b6de7d5bf504e6e9ad7cb57db7fec","sha":"c36d14a0897b6de7d5bf504e6e9ad7cb57db7fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/c36d14a0897b6de7d5bf504e6e9ad7cb57db7fec"}],"sha":"6a78a90aadc7c97c3ef00958e77dc487dafc7420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/6a78a90aadc7c97c3ef00958e77dc487dafc7420"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nacheal/erp-lite-microfrontends/commits/c36d14a0897b6de7d5bf504e6e9ad7cb57db7fec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T12:23:25Z","email":"michael@michael.local","name":"michael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T12:23:25Z","email":"michael@michael.local","name":"michael"},"mes