p/skip mid-step\n- Add pause/resume at execution level (routes, orchestrator forwarding, frontend button)\n- Separate infrastructure errors (ECONNREFUSED, DNS) from app bugs in reports\n- Bug analyzer skips infrastructure errors and skipped results\n- Optimize CDP live preview (15fps, everyNthFrame:1, quality:60)\n- BugsPage UI modernization with screenshot display and human-readable names\n- Orchestrator artifact proxy and execution event forwarding\n- Crawler and test-case-generation fixes","tree":{"sha":"11e48bd713313e50ab44172118a723fe646a22cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hassan-301/FYP-AutoValid/git/trees/11e48bd713313e50ab44172118a723fe646a22cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hassan-301/FYP-AutoValid/git/commits/6edc91b79f53b51038dd24c7361b42a3f33aba7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Hassan-301/FYP-AutoValid/commit/6edc91b79f53b51038dd24c7361b42a3f33aba7d","node_id":"C_kwDORdl40toAKDZlZGM5MWI3OWY1M2I1MTAzOGRkMjRjNzM2MWI0MmEzZjMzYWJhN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hassan-301/FYP-AutoValid/commit/216a39192523362887d127e234020fde2c674391","sha":"216a39192523362887d127e234020fde2c674391","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hassan-301/FYP-AutoValid/commits/216a39192523362887d127e234020fde2c674391"}],"sha":"6edc91b79f53b51038dd24c7361b42a3f33aba7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hassan-301/FYP-AutoValid/commits/6edc91b79f53b51038dd24c7361b42a3f33aba7d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hassan-301/FYP-AutoValid/commits/216a39192523362887d127e234020fde2c674391/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T00:43:56Z","email":"hassanpeshbeen301@gmail.com.com","name":"Hassan-303"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T00:43:56Z","email":"hassanpeshbeen301@gmail.com.com","name":"Hassan-303"},"message":"docs: update README, architecture, and all scripts (start-all, stop-all, d