d DI violation fix)\n- TenantAwareHangfireDashboardFilter: resolve ITenantService per-request from httpContext\n- JobsModuleExtensions: remove app.Services.GetRequiredService<ITenantService>() from root\n- TenantManagementExtensions: use ApplyMigrationsAsync (handles shared SQLite files)\n- MultiTenantWebAppFactory: add AuditDbContext + BillingDbContext to ReplaceDb/EnsureSchema\n- IntegrationWebAppFactory: add BillingDbContext to ReplaceDb\n- AnalyticsReadRepository: cross-database SQL (date(), CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, parameterized\n  cutoffs, julianday() instead of EXTRACT/EPOCH, drop TO_CHAR/INTERVAL syntax)\n- frontend/api/auth/register: add try/catch + AbortSignal.timeout(8000)\n- frontend/api/auth/login: add AbortSignal.timeout(8000)\n- frontend/register/page.tsx: add try/catch in onSubmit\n- e2e/auth.spec.ts: skip backend-dependent tests when backend unavailable\n\nResult: 0 failures, 264/264 tests passing\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"eaa0b4f06dabe4f0e1948fa270484160f809d83c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/eaa0b4f06dabe4f0e1948fa270484160f809d83c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/93bd2014c457d39f0c1a3f17b3e1d89edf1b759e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/93bd2014c457d39f0c1a3f17b3e1d89edf1b759e","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDkzYmQyMDE0YzQ1N2QzOWYwYzFhM2YxN2IzZTFkODllZGYxYjc1OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/6d33ca76dffeda75293b6fc922a9c9e8e64c52d8","sha":"6d33ca76dffeda75293b6fc922a9c9e8e64c52d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/6d33ca76dffeda75293b6fc922a9c9e8e64c52d8"}],"sha":"93bd2014c457d39f0c1a3f17b3e1d89edf1b759e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/93bd2014c457d39f0c