t, success state\n- BFF route /api/auth/signup: honeypot check + proxy to backend\n- 11 unit tests (EF InMemory + Moq) — validator, slug generation, entity creation, conflict detection\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb04c1fbb828b4ba735c7f57c0029a3b3c7ff20e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/eb04c1fbb828b4ba735c7f57c0029a3b3c7ff20e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/84ddd6345602fea475068895609c7978f5f9f81a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/84ddd6345602fea475068895609c7978f5f9f81a","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDg0ZGRkNjM0NTYwMmZlYTQ3NTA2ODg5NTYwOWM3OTc4ZjVmOWY4MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/9545ac5f29e347957c00a4c05195fc515373d3ee","sha":"9545ac5f29e347957c00a4c05195fc515373d3ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/9545ac5f29e347957c00a4c05195fc515373d3ee"}],"sha":"84ddd6345602fea475068895609c7978f5f9f81a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/84ddd6345602fea475068895609c7978f5f9f81a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/9545ac5f29e347957c00a4c05195fc515373d3ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T00:49:51Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T00:49:51Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(US-091): Billing & Subscription module — plans, quotas, Stripe NoOp\n\nImplements the full US-091 Billing module in the modular monolith:\n\nNew module (backend/src/Modules/Billing/):\n- Domain: Plan, Subscription, UsageRecord entities\n- Application: IBillingService / BillingService — subscription lifecycle,\n  quota enforcement (CheckQuotaAsync, IncrementUsageAsync, OverridePlanAsync)\n- Application: IStripeService / NoOpStripeService — Stripe checkout/webhook\n  (real implementation gated behind FeatureManagement:UseStripe flag)\n- Application: IRequiresQuota marker interface + QuotaBehavior<,> MediatR\n  pipeline behavior (runs after ValidationBehavior, throws QuotaExceededException)\n- Infrastructure: BillingDbContext with seeded Free/Pro/Enterprise plans\n- Api: BillingModule — GET /plans, GET /subscription, POST /admin/override,\n  POST /checkout, POST /webhook\n- BillingModuleExtensions: DI registration + InitializeBillingModuleAsync\n\nCross-cutting changes:\n- Shared/Abstractions/QuotaExceededException — HTTP 402 exception\n- Shared/Abstractions/Policies — adds AdminOnly constant\n- Shared/FeatureFlags/FeatureFlags — adds UseStripe constant\n- Shared/Errors/ExceptionHandlingMiddleware — maps QuotaExceededException → 402\n- Issues/Commands/IssueCommands — CreateIssueCommand implements IRequiresQuota\n- Auth/AuthModuleExtensions — AdminOnly policy uses Policies.AdminOnly constant\n- Program.cs — registers billing module, QuotaBehavior, BillingModule.Map()\n- appsettings.json — UseStripe: false + Stripe config section\n\nTests (7/7 passing):\n- BillingServiceTests: quota under/at limit, usage increment, plan override\n- QuotaBehaviorTests: passthrough, quota allowed, QuotaExceededException thrown\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"33599de2a6d7a9140b1b353696f0a4134ea8788e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/33599de2a6d7a9140b1b353696f0a4134ea8788e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/9545ac5f29e347957c00a4c05195fc515373d3ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/9545ac5f29e347957c00a4c05195fc515373d3ee","no