gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/491ec827a52ccf8fbce95be4f206e73b49df8323","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDQ5MWVjODI3YTUyY2NmOGZiY2U5NWJlNGYyMDZlNzNiNDlkZjgzMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/5e47dc720d55fe4e556f5c77a626fd8dba6af3ec","sha":"5e47dc720d55fe4e556f5c77a626fd8dba6af3ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/5e47dc720d55fe4e556f5c77a626fd8dba6af3ec"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/136662da6762cc8d6e7f9c43dac05d1347b37e9b","sha":"136662da6762cc8d6e7f9c43dac05d1347b37e9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/136662da6762cc8d6e7f9c43dac05d1347b37e9b"}],"sha":"491ec827a52ccf8fbce95be4f206e73b49df8323","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/491ec827a52ccf8fbce95be4f206e73b49df8323"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/136662da6762cc8d6e7f9c43dac05d1347b37e9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T00:20:46Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T00:20:46Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(US-090): Keycloak PoC — auth provider opcional via feature flag\n\nImplementa o Strangler Fig pattern para integrar Keycloak como identity\nprovider opcional, preservando o auth custom como fallback via feature flag.\n\n## Critérios implementados\n\n### Backend\n- Feature flag `UseKeycloak` adicionada em `FeatureFlags.cs`\n- `AuthModuleExtensions.cs` refatorado com dois paths de auth:\n  - `UseKeycloak=false` (padrão): JWT HMAC-SHA256 custom — zero regressão\n  - `UseKeycloak=true`: JWT Bearer via Keycloak OIDC (Authority/JWKS)\n- `KeycloakClaimsTransformation`: mapeia `realm_access.roles` → `ClaimTypes.Role`\n- `appsettings.json`: seção `Keycloak` + flag `UseKeycloak: false`\n- `appsettings.Development.json`: config Keycloak local (porta 8180)\n\n### Infra / Docker\n- `docker-compose.dev.yml`: serviço Keycloak 24 (porta 8180) + import automático do realm\n- `infra/keycloak/ims-realm.json`: realm `ims` completo com roles (Admin/Manager/User),\n  clients (ims-backend bearer-only + ims-frontend PKCE), protocol mapper para claim `roles`\n\n### Frontend (Next.js BFF)\n- `lib/keycloak.ts`: utilities PKCE (code_verifier, code_challenge, buildAuthorizationUrl,\n  exchangeCodeForTokens, refreshKeycloakTokens)\n- `/api/auth/keycloak-login`: inicia fluxo PKCE, gera verifier/state, redireciona ao Keycloak\n- `/api/auth/keycloak-callback`: valida state, troca code por tokens, seta cookies HttpOnly\n- Login page: botão \"Entrar com Keycloak (SSO)\" visível quando NEXT_PUBLIC_USE_KEYCLOAK=true\n\n### Testes\n- `FeatureFlagsTests.cs`: inclui `UseKeycloak` nos testes de constantes\n- `KeycloakAuthTests.cs`: 8 testes unitários — KeycloakClaimsTransformation (5 cenários),\n  feature flag constant, startup config selection (2 testes)\n\n### Documentação\n- `docs/ADR-003-keycloak-auth.md`: decisão de arquitetura, diagrama, trade-offs, alternativas\n- `docs/KEYCLOAK.md`: guia operacional, setup, fluxo PKCE, claims mapping, troubleshooting\n\n## Resultado\n- 190/190 testes unitários/módulos passando (+8 novos do US-090)\n- 56 falhas de integration tests são pre-existentes (issue de startup no CI local)\n- Build Release: 0 errors, 2 warnings pre-existentes\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7f61fe21963c05434ee87512eed4aa12833c716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/c7f61fe21963c05434ee87512eed4aa12833c716"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/136662da6762cc8d6e7f9c43dac05d1347b37e9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/136662da6762cc8d6e7f9c43dac05d1347b37e9b","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDEzNjY2MmRhNjc2MmNjOGQ2ZTdmOWM0M2RhYzA1ZDEzNDdiMzdlOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/5e47dc720d55fe4e556f5c77a626fd8dba6af3ec","sha":"5e47dc720d55fe4e556f5c77a626fd8dba6af3ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/5e47dc720d55fe4e556f5c77a626fd8dba6af3ec"}],"sha":"136662da6762cc8d6e7f9c43dac05d1347b37e9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/136662da6762cc8d6e7f9c43dac05d1347b37e9b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/5e47dc720d55fe4e556f5c77a626fd8dba6af3ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T18:32:59Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T18:32:59Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"docs(squad): adiciona seção Skills nos charters de Morpheus, Neo e Trinity\n\nAgentes não referenciavam as skills do projeto nos charters, fazendo com que ignorassem as 15 skills de ims-modular-patterns ao trabalhar nas USs. Adicionada seção ## Skills em cada charter com as skills relevantes ao papel de cada agente.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"59531a994420553865bc22922feec292f7f95f2e","url":"https://api.github.com