rker (public/sw.js) with cache-first, SWR and network-first strategies\n- Add Web App Manifest (public/manifest.json) and offline fallback page\n- Add SwRegister component for SW registration with auto-update after 30s\n- Add InstallPrompt component for native PWA install banner\n- Add PushOptIn component for Web Push subscription toggle\n- Add API routes: /api/push/{vapid-public-key,subscribe,unsubscribe,broadcast}\n- Add push-store.ts (in-memory subscription store, globalThis singleton)\n- Add push-notifications.ts utilities for subscribe/unsubscribe\n- Add scripts/generate-pwa-icons.mjs for solid-color PNG icon generation\n- Generate 4 PWA icons (192/512, any/maskable) in public/icons/\n- Update app/layout.tsx with PWA metadata, SwRegister and InstallPrompt\n- Add .env.local.example with VAPID key configuration instructions\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"95159112763c2af02f7827e8619f3a3ee26755e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/95159112763c2af02f7827e8619f3a3ee26755e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/834759b893e47ba42ba41d823cb629b8514b4a35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/834759b893e47ba42ba41d823cb629b8514b4a35","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDgzNDc1OWI4OTNlNDdiYTQyYmE0MWQ4MjNjYjYyOWI4NTE0YjRhMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/f580d4505160831f243e502bb09bd3f12b30273a","sha":"f580d4505160831f243e502bb09bd3f12b30273a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/f580d4505160831f243e502bb09bd3f12b30273a"}],"sha":"834759b893e47ba42ba41d823cb629b8514b4a35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/834759b893e47ba42ba41d823cb629b8514b4a35"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repo