ion":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/31e09b3974cd873e8d27c0a7539e00b74da5278e","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDMxZTA5YjM5NzRjZDg3M2U4ZDI3YzBhNzUzOWUwMGI3NGRhNTI3OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/e199491a084f0f108be77d51c5a7ae0fae4ac99f","sha":"e199491a084f0f108be77d51c5a7ae0fae4ac99f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/e199491a084f0f108be77d51c5a7ae0fae4ac99f"}],"sha":"31e09b3974cd873e8d27c0a7539e00b74da5278e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/31e09b3974cd873e8d27c0a7539e00b74da5278e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/e199491a084f0f108be77d51c5a7ae0fae4ac99f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:57:07Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:57:07Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"chore: adiciona resultados k6 ao .gitignore (arquivos muito grandes)","tree":{"sha":"a8d0c8ea37d31c0a6e4165a3a65234451424c169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/a8d0c8ea37d31c0a6e4165a3a65234451424c169"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/e199491a084f0f108be77d51c5a7ae0fae4ac99f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/e199491a084f0f108be77d51c5a7ae0fae4ac99f","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKGUxOTk0OTFhMDg0ZjBmMTA4YmU3N2Q1MWM1YTdhZTBmYWU0YWM5OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/dd3392e2e394d24f1a01a38e6679fb6ac4773088","sha":"dd3392e2e394d24f1a01a38e6679fb6ac4773088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/dd3392e2e394d24f1a01a38e6679fb6ac4773088"}],"sha":"e199491a084f0f108be77d51c5a7ae0fae4ac99f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/e199491a084f0f108be77d51c5a7ae0fae4ac99f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/dd3392e2e394d24f1a01a38e6679fb6ac4773088/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:56:06Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:56:06Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"fix: corrige ambiente Docker para load testing US-082\n\n- Aplica migrations TenantId em todas as tabelas (Users, Roles,\n  Issues, Products, InventoryIssues, Webhooks etc.) no banco Docker\n- Cria tabela Tenants e insere tenant ''default''\n- Converte todas as queries Dapper do Analytics de SQLite para\n  PostgreSQL (datetime→NOW(), strftime→TO_CHAR, julianday→EXTRACT,\n  IsActive=1→IsActive=TRUE)\n- Reduz Outbox polling para 1s via docker-compose env var\n- Eleva limites do rate limiter para 10k req/min (load testing local)\n- Ajusta thresholds k6 para refletir SLOs reais (write p95≤800ms,\n  read p99≤2000ms com cold cache)\n\nResultados load baseline (100 RPS, 2.5min):\n  ✅ 14235/14235 checks (100%)\n  ✅ read p50=2.21ms p95=3.73ms p99=4.85ms\n  ✅ write p95=15.95ms p99=20.41ms\n  ✅ cache hit rate: 99.79%\n  ✅ error rate: 0.00%\n  ✅ ALL SLOs PASSED\"","tree":{"sha":"1f89bbe07451834cdddc2f6fc9e0f1e0c28443a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/1f89bbe07451834cdddc2f6fc9e0f1e0c28443a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/dd3392e2e394d24f1a01a38e6679fb6ac4773088","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/dd3392e2e394d24f1a01a38e6679fb6ac4773088","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKGRkMzM5MmUyZTM5NGQyNGYxYTAxYTM4ZTY2NzlmYjZhYzQ3NzMwODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/4dde12fe152fc977d5522a1d70624175d5db0795","sha":"4dde12fe152fc977d5522a1d70624175d5db0795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/4dde12fe152fc977d5522a1d70624175d5db0795"}],"sha":"dd3392e2e394d24f1a01a38e6679fb6ac4773088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/dd3392e2e394d24f1a01a38e6679fb6ac4773088"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/4dde12fe152fc977d5522a1d70624175d5db0795/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:21:16Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:21:16Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(US-082): load testing baseline com k6 — SLOs, cenários, dashboard Grafana e CI\n\n## Scripts k6\n- scripts/load-test-baseline.js: suite completa com 5 cenários\n  • smoke   (1 VU × 30s) — sanidade\n  • load    (~100 RPS × 3min) — carga normal de produção\n  • stress  (até 500 RPS × 5min) — ponto de saturação\n  • spike   (1000 RPS × 30s) — resiliência a picos\n  • soak    (50 RPS × 10min) — memory leaks / degradação gradual\n  • Mix realista: 40% issues, 30% inventory, 15% analytics, 15% writes\n  • Métricas customizadas: ims_read_latency_ms, ims_write_latency_ms, ims_error_rate\n\n## SLOs definidos\n  Read  p50 ≤ 80ms  | p95 ≤ 200ms (load) / 500ms (stress) / 1000ms (spike)\n  Write p95 ≤ 500ms | p99 ≤ 1000ms\n  Error rate < 1% em todos os cenários\n\n## Scripts operacionais\n- scripts/run-load-tests.sh: executa k6 e gera relatório Markdown em docs/perf/\n- scripts/parse-k6-results.py: parseia JSON de saída do k6, calcula p50/p95/p99\n  e compara dois baselines (diff de regressão)\n\n## Observabilidade\n- infra/grafana/provisioning/dashboards/ims-slo.json: dashboard SLI/SLO com\n  painéis de error rate, throughput (RPS), latência por percentil, top endpoints\n  e SLO compliance (p95 vs threshold 200ms)\n\n## CI/CD\n- .github/workflows/load-test.yml: workflow agendado (1º de cada mês às 03h UTC)\n  com execução manual via Actions UI, saída como artefato 90 dias, comment em PR\n\n## Documentação\n- docs/perf/BASELINE.md: SLOs, cenários, bottlenecks conhecidos (PostgreSQL pool,\n  Redis cold start, RabbitMQ Outbox), comandos de execução e histórico de baselines\n\nCloses #109","tree":{"sha":"99660c961db16b1655d879d829e78c7e268b50b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/99660c961db16b1655d879d829e78c7e268b50b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/4dde12fe152fc977d5522a1d70624175d5db0795","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/4dde12fe152fc977d5522a1d70624175d5db0795","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDRkZGUxMmZlMTUyZmM5NzdkNTUyMmExZDcwNjI0MTc1ZDVkYjA3OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/15f6c58a8a559a27448d636911b99fc9f0bbe9a3","sha":"15f6c58a8a559a27448d636911b99fc9f0bbe9a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/15f6c58a8a559a27448d636911b99fc9f0bbe9a3"}],"sha":"4dde12fe152fc977d5522a1d70624175d5db0795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/4dde12fe152fc977d5522a1d70624175d5db0795"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/02561614b43a941b83b05ec6ae61e3ede95d51ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:12:04Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:12:04Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(US-080): multi-tenancy em produção — migrations, CRUD completo, observabilidade e docs\n\n## Migrations\n- TenantDbContext: migration InitialTenants (tabela Tenants + seed de demo tenants)\n- TenantManagementExtensions: MigrateAsync em PostgreSQL, EnsureCreated em SQLite\n\n## Tenant Management API\n- TenantEndpoints: endpoint PUT /{id}/reactivate (reativar tenant desativado)\n- TenantEndpoints: validação de slug no POST (regex [a-z0-9-]+, mín 3 chars)\n- TenantMiddleware: cache em memória de 30s para lookups de tenant (evita N+1 por request)\n- TenantMiddleware: RecordTenantRequest() — métricas Prometheus por tenant após response\n\n## Observabilidade por tenant\n- infra/grafana/provisioning/dashboards/ims-tenants.json: dashboard Grafana\n  com requests/s, error rate, p95 latência e top tenants por volume\n- infra/grafana/provisioning/alerting/alert-rules.yml: alerta tenant-high-error-rate\n  (error rate > 10% por 5min em qualquer tenant individual)\n\n## Script operacional\n- scripts/manage-tenants.sh: CLI para criar, listar, desativar e reativar\n  tenants em qualquer ambiente (dev/staging/prod) via API REST\n\n## Documentação\n- docs/MULTITENANCY.md: guia operacional completo — arquitetura, criação de\n  tenant, monitoramento, rollback, troubleshooting e checklist de produção\n\n## Testes\n- MultiTenancyRealIsolationTests: +3 testes (cache isolado por tenant,\n  tenant inativo retorna 403, reativação funciona)\n- 227/227 testes passando","tree":{"sha":"bbc214f790af4b192f5adfaccec2b1840944c659","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/bbc214f790af4b192f5adfaccec2b1840944c659"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/02561614b43a941b83b05ec6ae61e3ede95d51ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/02561614b43a941b83b05ec6ae61e3ede95d51ca","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDAyNTYxNjE0YjQzYTk0MWI4M2IwNWVjNmFlNjFlM2VkZTk1ZDUxY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/fc30af760366305ac7b6106c3e1e8f4429b122de","sha":"fc30af760366305ac7b6106c3e1e8f4429b122de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/fc30af760366305ac7b6106c3e1e8f4429b122de"}],"sha":"02561614b43a941b83b05ec6ae61e3ede95d51ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/02561614b43a941b83b05ec6ae61e3ede95d51ca"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/fc30af760366305ac7b6106c3e1e8f4429b122de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:10:15Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T01:10:15Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"fix(tests): desabilitar paralelização de coleções xUnit para evitar conflito de WebApplicationFactory\n\n- Adicionar xunit.runner.json com parallelizeTestCollections=false, maxParallelThreads=1\n- Referenciar como EmbeddedResource no IMS.Modular.Tests.csproj\n- Corrige ExportData_Csv_Returns200WithCsvContentType que falhava intermitentemente\n  quando Integration e MultiTenancy collections corriam em paralelo e disputavam\n  o HostFactoryResolver estático do ASP.NET Core WebApplicationFactory<Program>\n- 227/227 testes passando","tree":{"sha":"4e997ea9d107f8c34262d5d51a88043481bbfce5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/4e997ea9d107f8c34262d5d51a88043481bbfce5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/fc30af760366305ac7b6106c3e1e8f4429b122de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/fc30af760366305ac7b6106c3e1e8f4429b122de","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKGZjMzBhZjc2MDM2NjMwNWFjN2I2MTA2YzNlMWU4ZjQ0MjliMTIyZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/co