43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T00:33:29Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T00:33:29Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"fix(multi-tenancy): US-078/080 — corrigir isolamento real de dados por tenant\n\n- CachingBehavior: incluir tenantId na cache key (fix cross-tenant cache leak)\n- IssueQueryHandlers: IgnoreQueryFilters() + WithTenantFilter(tenantService) explícito\n- InventoryReadRepositories: filtro por TenantId em todas queries Dapper\n- InventoryQueryHandlers: cache keys manuais incluem tenantId\n- TenantAwareDbContext: TenantModelCacheKeyFactory para isolar modelos compilados por tenant\n- TenantQueryExtensions: helper WithTenantFilter<T>() para IQueryable<ITenantEntity>\n- TenantMiddleware: validação de tenant ativo + enriquecimento de traces\n- TenantManagement: TenantDbContext, TenantEntity, TenantEndpoints (/api/tenants)\n- MultiTenancyRealIsolationTests: 7 testes de isolamento real (todos passando)\n- MultiTenantWebAppFactory: factory com seed de dados por tenant para testes\n\nResultado: 224/224 testes passando, sem regressões","tree":{"sha":"d6ab5bc44a468e6785713dbda45e0e2ae043ba6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/d6ab5bc44a468e6785713dbda45e0e2ae043ba6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/12acfa9170092da2852494aeebaef99ac3fda543","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/12acfa9170092da2852494aeebaef99ac3fda543","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDEyYWNmYTkxNzAwOTJkYTI4NTI0OTRhZWViYWVmOTlhYzNmZGE1NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/1a50bdd890b2f8a370f920600c55fc08b299a271","sha":"1a50bdd890b2f8a370f920600c55fc08b299a271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/1a50bdd890b2f8a370f920600c55fc08b299a271"}],"sha":"12acfa9170092da2852494aeebaef99ac3fda543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/12acfa9170092da2852494aeebaef99ac3fda543"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/1a50bdd890b2f8a370f920600c55fc08b299a271/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T00:05:47Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T00:05:47Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(ops): US-081 — automated PostgreSQL backup & disaster recovery\n\n- scripts/backup-postgres.sh: pg_dump → gzip → S3 upload with daily/weekly/\n  monthly tiering and configurable retention pruning\n- scripts/restore-postgres.sh: download from S3 (or local file), pre-restore\n  safety dump, DROP/CREATE DB and pipe through psql; FORCE flag for\n  populated targets\n- Dockerfile.backup: alpine + postgresql16-client + aws-cli image\n- docker-compose.yml: `backup` service under the `backup` profile, mapping\n  BACKUP_* env vars onto script-native names (S3_BUCKET, AWS_*, RETENTION_*)\n- .env.example: full Backup & DR section with BACKUP_* prefixed variables\n- docs/RUNBOOK.md: SLOs (RTO 4h / RPO 24h), backup strategy, Kubernetes\n  CronJob template, restore procedure for staging/production/partial,\n  monthly/quarterly DR drill cadence and operational procedures\n- docs/EVOLUTION_PLAN.md: marks D-24/D-25 as resolved and US-081 as\n  delivered; updates DR success metrics","tree":{"sha":"1198d85ea5ec72c7d77c725ee8238d91940def35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/1198d85ea5ec72c7d77c725ee8238d91940def35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/1a50bdd890b2f8a370f920600c55fc08b299a271","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null