mmandHandlerTests, IssueCommandHandlerTests, BackgroundJobsTests:\n  adapt for multi-tenancy model changes\"","tree":{"sha":"ad55a9bf915565860dd1212d15560b22baf9169d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/ad55a9bf915565860dd1212d15560b22baf9169d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/906972591cdc758789c52299d20d8df41a64aa8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/906972591cdc758789c52299d20d8df41a64aa8e","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDkwNjk3MjU5MWNkYzc1ODc4OWM1MjI5OWQyMGQ4ZGY0MWE2NGFhOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/0e8601ab0de92d6a8871f9ecb04cc192f0091949","sha":"0e8601ab0de92d6a8871f9ecb04cc192f0091949","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/0e8601ab0de92d6a8871f9ecb04cc192f0091949"}],"sha":"906972591cdc758789c52299d20d8df41a64aa8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/906972591cdc758789c52299d20d8df41a64aa8e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/0e8601ab0de92d6a8871f9ecb04cc192f0091949/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T02:48:35Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T02:48:35Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(auth): add UserManagement module and update app config\n\n- Add UserManagement module (US-064) replacing deprecated UserAdminModule\n- Register new module in Program.cs\n- Update appsettings with feature flags and multi-tenancy config\"","tree":{"sha":"e840faf848bed59cd8a57a2517cebe4794a8e675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/e840faf848bed59cd8a57a2517cebe4794a8e675"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/