df33877eca8","sha":"badd1f3e9f2743634c65e87f08818df33877eca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/badd1f3e9f2743634c65e87f08818df33877eca8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/1100aea015866121d3e59e590899931294992cac","sha":"1100aea015866121d3e59e590899931294992cac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/1100aea015866121d3e59e590899931294992cac"}],"sha":"37b733e1a57241676e6209b12074e63681a5f081","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/37b733e1a57241676e6209b12074e63681a5f081"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/1100aea015866121d3e59e590899931294992cac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T22:14:08Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T22:14:08Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(sprint-12): US-078 multi-tenancy PoC + US-079 issues microservice\n\nUS-078 — Multi-Tenancy PoC:\n- Shared/MultiTenancy: ITenantService, TenantContext, TenantMiddleware,\n  TenantAwareDbContext, MultiTenancyExtensions\n- TenantMiddleware: resolve via X-Tenant-Id header → JWT claim → ''default''\n- TenantContext.HasTenant helper property\n- Inventory/Application/TenantInventorySeed: seed 3 produtos para tenant-alpha\n  e 3 para tenant-beta\n- Program.cs: AddMultiTenancy() + UseMultiTenancy() registrados\n- ADR-001-multi-tenancy.md: decisão arquitetural documentada\n- tests: TenantContextTests (7 unitários) + TenantIsolationIntegrationTests (5)\n\nUS-079 — Issues Microservice PoC:\n- services/ims-issues-service: CRUD completo, JWT, health checks, Swagger\n- Messaging: IssuesEventPublisher (lazy async, sem .GetAwaiter().GetResult()),\n  IssuesEventConsumer, RabbitMqOptions\n- Dockerfile + docker-compose.yml: serviço issues-service adicionado\n- Shared/Proxy/IssuesProxyExtensions: YARP routing /api/issues → microservice\n- appsettings.json: IssuesProxy YARP config + UseIssuesMicroservice feature flag\n- ADR-002-issues-microservice.md: Strangler Fig pattern documentado\n- tests: IssuesMicroserviceIntegrationTests (4 testes)\n\nFixes:\n- WebhookRepository: .ContinueWith(t => t.Result) → async/await\n- AnalyticsService: .Result após WhenAll → await\n- SearchServiceTests: Arg.Any<string[]>() para fix de NullRef no NSubstitute\n- ProviderPactTests: migrado para PactNet v5 IPactVerifier API\n- ProviderStatesMiddleware: using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Builder\n- IMS.Modular.Tests.csproj: NSubstitute, Microsoft.FeatureManagement,\n  SDK Web para suporte ao WebApplication nos testes de contrato\n\nTests: 22/22 ✅","tree":{"sha":"cfb6f3509c2769a85d5570a211fe7a58e22abcb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/cfb6f3509c2769a85d5570a211fe7a58e22abcb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/1100aea015866121d3e59e590899931294992cac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/1100aea015866121d3e59e590899931294992cac","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDExMDBhZWEwMTU4NjYxMjFkM2U1OWU1OTA4OTk5MzEyOTQ5OTJjYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/badd1f3e9f2743634c65e87f08818df33877eca8","sha":"badd1f3e9f2743634c65e87f08818df33877eca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/badd1f3e9f2743634c65e87f08818df33877eca8"}],"sha":"1100aea015866121d3e59e590899931294992cac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/1100aea015866121d3e59e590899931294992cac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/badd1f3e9f2743634c65e87f08818df33877eca8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T21:00:04Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},