ge":"feat(US-071): Full-text search cross-módulo com Meilisearch\n\nBackend:\n- Pacote MeiliSearch 0.14.3 instalado\n- SearchModule: ISearchService + MeilisearchService (Rust engine)\n- Indexação assíncrona via domain events: IssueCreatedEvent, ProductCreatedEvent\n- Endpoint GET /api/search?q=...&modules=issues,inventory&page=1&pageSize=20\n- Inicialização dos indexes ''issues'' e ''inventory'' no startup\n- Configuração via appsettings.json (Meilisearch:Host, Meilisearch:ApiKey)\n- 5 testes unitários do SearchService\n\nInfra:\n- Container meilisearch:v1.7 adicionado ao docker-compose.yml\n- Volume meilisearch_data persistente\n- Env vars Meilisearch__Host e Meilisearch__ApiKey no serviço app\n\nFrontend:\n- Hook useSearch com React Query (ativado a partir de 2 caracteres)\n- Componente GlobalSearchBar no header com resultados em dropdown\n- Chaves i18n search.* em pt.json e en.json\n- Feature flag EnableFullTextSearch ativada em produção\n\nCloses #93","tree":{"sha":"48baafa370f2ae550c50725a6f8407b3222eeb83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/48baafa370f2ae550c50725a6f8407b3222eeb83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/18f60941dddf620e14e55ce7b200f3f5788271af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/18f60941dddf620e14e55ce7b200f3f5788271af","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDE4ZjYwOTQxZGRkZjYyMGUxNGU1NWNlN2IyMDBmM2Y1Nzg4MjcxYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67","sha":"fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67"}],"sha":"18f60941dddf620e14e55ce7b200f3f5788271af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/18f60941dddf620e14e55ce7b200f3f5788271af"},