eleverton/ims-monolith/commits/bcd0b3a46076f0064208b8c0add6539943e3ad43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T20:35:29Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T20:35:29Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(US-072): Compressão Brotli para assets Blazor WASM\n\n- Dockerfile.frontend: instala brotli e comprime .wasm, .dll, .js com --best\n- next.config.ts: Cache-Control immutable para /_blazor/*\n- next.config.ts: Content-Encoding: br + Content-Type corretos para .br files\n- Redução esperada: ~8MB → ~2MB (~75%) nos assets WASM\n\nCloses #94","tree":{"sha":"d265183bba9a9dac67740e3a9f1cb2f787871921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/d265183bba9a9dac67740e3a9f1cb2f787871921"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/bcd0b3a46076f0064208b8c0add6539943e3ad43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/bcd0b3a46076f0064208b8c0add6539943e3ad43","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKGJjZDBiM2E0NjA3NmYwMDY0MjA4YjhjMGFkZDY1Mzk5NDNlM2FkNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67","sha":"fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67"}],"sha":"bcd0b3a46076f0064208b8c0add6539943e3ad43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/bcd0b3a46076f0064208b8c0add6539943e3ad43"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/56244fcfacbf82cca7543b3c981d9716fbace2e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T20:34:46Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T20:34:46Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(US-074): Feature Flags com Microsoft.FeatureManagement\n\n- Pacote Microsoft.FeatureManagement.AspNetCore instalado\n- FeatureFlags constants: EnableKanbanView, EnableWebhooks, EnableFullTextSearch\n- FeatureFlagsExtensions para registro no DI\n- Endpoint GET /api/features retorna estado das flags\n- Flags configuradas em appsettings.json (prod) e appsettings.Development.json\n- Frontend: hook useFeatureFlags/useFeatureFlag com React Query\n- Frontend: componente FeatureGate para renderização condicional\n- 3 testes unitários (backend) + 3 testes (frontend hook)\n\nCloses #96","tree":{"sha":"5274fad0b59044723039ca9a18dad83e3b4ab919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/5274fad0b59044723039ca9a18dad83e3b4ab919"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/56244fcfacbf82cca7543b3c981d9716fbace2e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/56244fcfacbf82cca7543b3c981d9716fbace2e2","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDU2MjQ0ZmNmYWNiZjgyY2NhNzU0M2IzYzk4MWQ5NzE2ZmJhY2UyZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67","sha":"fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67"}],"sha":"56244fcfacbf82cca7543b3c981d9716fbace2e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/56244fcfacbf82cca7543b3c981d9716fbace2e2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T19:46:25Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T19:46:25Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"fix(auth): resolve PendingModelChangesWarning blocking migrations in production\n\n- Replace dynamic SHA256.HashData() in HasData with pre-computed static constant\n  SHA256(''Admin@123!'') = ''bPDqVeX9XmkuAHsWM5qD9DGTcM24thk8FjCCARnLulA=''\n- Add ConfigureWarnings(Ignore PendingModelChangesWarning) in AuthDbContext.OnConfiguring\n- Remove unused System.Security.Cryptography and System.Text usings\n\nRoot cause: EF''s MigrateAsync() throws when model is marked non-deterministic,\npreventing RefreshTokens table creation and blocking login (HTTP 500)","tree":{"sha":"c28ea608906ee038e938dd3398a5f3d403e583a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/c28ea608906ee038e938dd3398a5f3d403e583a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKGZhOWIwMWUxNDY0OWJjM2M0YWVmM2IxOTQwNWE3NGNlODg5Y2NkNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/80e4076ad10183478e9b88b0e19ef562a3873232","sha":"80e4076ad10183478e9b88b0e19ef562a3873232","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/80e4076ad10183478e9b88b0e19ef562a3873232"}],"sha":"fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/fa9b01e14649bc3c4aef3b19405a74ce889ccd67"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/80e4076ad10183478e9b88b0e19ef562a3873232/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T19:24:15Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T19:24:15Z","emai