,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/9b7bbd1af9ae7738ce558702e79b4c2ae0671ec3","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDliN2JiZDFhZjlhZTc3MzhjZTU1ODcwMmU3OWI0YzJhZTA2NzFlYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/4ac239db107c01d563767c29e1481d6ee4ce2614","sha":"4ac239db107c01d563767c29e1481d6ee4ce2614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/4ac239db107c01d563767c29e1481d6ee4ce2614"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/7039b776de1cb271e839c4820499fedf98d41677","sha":"7039b776de1cb271e839c4820499fedf98d41677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/7039b776de1cb271e839c4820499fedf98d41677"}],"sha":"9b7bbd1af9ae7738ce558702e79b4c2ae0671ec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/9b7bbd1af9ae7738ce558702e79b4c2ae0671ec3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/87344a57833664348ff4e031abee1a7f9c2a557f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T19:04:51Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T19:04:51Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(webhooks): US-069 - Webhooks outbound module\n\nDomain:\n- WebhookRegistration entity (url, secret, events[], isActive, ownerId)\n- WebhookDelivery entity (attempts, success, statusCode, errorMessage)\n- WebhookEventNames constants (issue.created, issue.resolved, stock.low, user.invited)\n\nInfrastructure:\n- WebhooksDbContext with WebhookRegistrations + WebhookDeliveries tables\n- Events stored as JSON column\n- EF Core migration: InitialSchema\n\nApplication:\n- WebhookSigner: HMAC-SHA256 signing/verification (GitHub/Stripe pattern)\n  Header: X-IMS-Signature: sha256=<hex>\n- WebhookRepository: GetActiveByEvent, GetByOwner, Add, SaveDelivery\n- IssueCreatedWebhookDispatcher: MediatR INotificationHandler<IssueCreatedEvent>\n- IssueResolvedWebhookDispatcher: MediatR INotificationHandler<IssueCompletedEvent>\n  Both: serialize payload → sign → publish to RabbitMQ ims.webhooks exchange\n- WebhookDeliveryConsumer: BackgroundService consuming webhooks.delivery queue\n  HTTP POST with X-IMS-Signature + X-IMS-Event headers\n  Retry 3x with exponential backoff (5s → 25s → 125s)\n  Persists WebhookDelivery log per attempt\n\nAPI:\n- POST   /api/webhooks        — register endpoint (auto-generates secret)\n- GET    /api/webhooks        — list registrations for authenticated user\n- DELETE /api/webhooks/{id}   — soft-deactivate (owner-only)\n- GET    /api/webhooks/events — list supported event names (public)\n\nTests:\n- 15 unit tests, all passing\n  Covers: entity lifecycle, signing, verify, repository, dispatchers","tree":{"sha":"88fccc049a89bfb5a8ed3ccb913421a34ebef813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/88fccc049a89bfb5a8ed3ccb913421a34ebef813"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/87344a57833664348ff4e031abee1a7f9c2a557f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/87344a57833664348ff4e031abee1a7f9c2a557f","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDg3MzQ0YTU3ODMzNjY0MzQ4ZmY0ZTAzMWFiZWUxYTdmOWMyYTU1N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/7039b776de1cb271e839c4820499fedf98d41677","sha":"7039b776de1cb271e839c4820499fedf98d41677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/7039b776de1cb271e839c4820499fedf98d41677"}],"sha":"87344a57833664348ff4e031abee1a7f9c2a557f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/87344a57833664348ff4e031abee1a7f9c2a557f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/7039b776de1cb271e839c4820499fedf98d41677/comments","commit":{"aut