  — histórico paginado + unreadCount\n  POST /api/notifications/{id}/read — marcar como lida\n\nTestes unitários: 10/10 passando\n  Notification entity: 3 testes (IsRead, MarkAsRead, idempotência)\n  NotificationRepository: 6 testes (add, unread count, isolação por user, paginação, GetById)\n  SendNotificationHandler: 1 teste (cria e persiste)\n\nUnit tests total: 111/111 passando\n\nCloses #88","tree":{"sha":"7f20cc1f0cd47ca478c02c808f6903ac6436889c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/7f20cc1f0cd47ca478c02c808f6903ac6436889c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/d4e555f41aba45a8c8086a3a596c787fc944cf9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/d4e555f41aba45a8c8086a3a596c787fc944cf9c","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKGQ0ZTU1NWY0MWFiYTQ1YThjODA4NmEzYTU5NmM3ODdmYzk0NGNmOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/4b0f108beb50014c484d502f89ce225a6ffe05f0","sha":"4b0f108beb50014c484d502f89ce225a6ffe05f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/4b0f108beb50014c484d502f89ce225a6ffe05f0"}],"sha":"d4e555f41aba45a8c8086a3a596c787fc944cf9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/d4e555f41aba45a8c8086a3a596c787fc944cf9c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29874478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peleverton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peleverton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peleverton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peleverton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton","id":29874478,"login":"peleverton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODc0NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peleverton/orgs","recei