ton Borges"},"message":"docs: atualiza EVOLUTION_PLAN.md — plano de evolução pós US-059 [v2.0]","tree":{"sha":"a2b1c3b014f7124aea50e5398111a8425b51962a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/a2b1c3b014f7124aea50e5398111a8425b51962a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/10fe905730c0907e8f6860859b4a1ccf83c0b007","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/10fe905730c0907e8f6860859b4a1ccf83c0b007","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDEwZmU5MDU3MzBjMDkwN2U4ZjY4NjA4NTliNGExY2NmODNjMGIwMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/044ab96db2bc151831481f0e88e1045bb0528585","sha":"044ab96db2bc151831481f0e88e1045bb0528585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/044ab96db2bc151831481f0e88e1045bb0528585"}],"sha":"10fe905730c0907e8f6860859b4a1ccf83c0b007","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/10fe905730c0907e8f6860859b4a1ccf83c0b007"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/044ab96db2bc151831481f0e88e1045bb0528585/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T15:18:52Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T15:18:52Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(tests): implement US-058 (unit tests React) and US-059 (E2E Playwright — Analytics + Blazor)\n\nUS-058: Vitest + React Testing Library — 43 unit tests (5 files)\n- vitest.config.ts + vitest.setup.ts: jsdom env, globals, @testing-library/jest-dom\n- package.json: added test, test:watch, test:coverage scripts\n- __tests__/ui/button.test.tsx (9 tests): render, click, disabled, loading spinner,\n  variants (primary/danger), sizes (sm/lg), attribute forwarding\n- __tests__/analytics/export-button.test.tsx (8 tests): dropdown render, open/close,\n  fetch params (JSON/CSV), module param, loading state, error display\n- __tests__/lib/api-fetch.test.ts (11 tests): Authorization header injection/skip,\n  Content-Type, 200/204/401/404/500 handling, custom headers, POST body\n- __tests__/lib/utils.test.ts (9 tests): cn() merger — single, multi, conflict\n  resolution, falsy values, conditional object, array, empty, complex tailwind\n- __tests__/hooks/use-notifications.test.tsx (6 tests): NotificationProvider\n  initial state, markAllRead, clearAll, markRead no-throw, outside-provider error\n\nUS-059: Expanded E2E Playwright — dashboard.spec.ts\n- Analytics heading and URL validation\n- <analytics-dashboard> custom element attached to DOM (BLAZOR_TIMEOUT=30s)\n- Blazor WASM init: skeleton disappears / component becomes visible\n- KPI cards contain numeric values after Blazor renders\n- Export button visible, dropdown opens with JSON/CSV, closes on neutral click\n- Navigation to /analytics via sidebar works and reloads correctly\n- page.reload() preserves analytics heading and custom element","tree":{"sha":"811fd313a229278cdd10f29389ea7f415af1a3c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/811fd313a229278cdd10f29389ea7f415af1a3c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/044ab96db2bc151831481f0e88e1045bb0528585","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/044ab96db2bc151831481f0e88e1045bb0528585","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDA0NGFiOTZkYjJiYzE1MTgzMTQ4MWYwZTg4ZTEwNDViYjA1Mjg1ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/2c608c491fecae50e77c44bfa8261a3f741e9c1c","sha":"2c608c491fecae50e77c44bfa8261a3f741e9c1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/2c608c491fecae50e77c44bfa8261a3f741e9c1c"}],"sha":"044ab96db2bc151831481f0e88e1045bb0528585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/044ab96db2bc151831481f0e88e1045bb0528585"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/2c608c491fecae50e77c44bfa8261a3f741e9c1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:42:54Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:42:54Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(auth,rbac): implement US-055 (rotative refresh token) and US-057 (granular RBAC policies)\n\nUS-055: Rotative Refresh Token\n- New entity RefreshToken with TokenHash (SHA-256), UserId, ExpiresAt, RevokedAt, ReplacedByTokenHash\n- Tokens stored hashed in RefreshTokens table (never raw) — cascade delete on user removal\n- AuthenticationService.RefreshTokenAsync: validates token via DB lookup, revokes old token,\n  records ReplacedByTokenHash, issues brand-new pair atomically\n- New LogoutAsync: finds token by hash, revokes it explicitly\n- New POST /api/auth/logout endpoint — revokes refresh token, returns 200/400\n- Legacy RefreshToken column on User preserved for migration compatibility\n\nUS-057: Granular RBAC Policies\n- New Policies static class in Shared/Abstractions with 5 named policies:\n    CanManageUsers    → Admin only\n    CanCreateIssue    → Any authenticated user\n    CanManageIssues   → Admin or Manager\n    CanViewInventory  → Any authenticated user\n    CanManageInventory → Admin or Manager\n    CanViewAnalytics  → Admin or Manager\n- All policies registered in AuthModuleExtensions.AddAuthorization\n- Applied to modules:\n    Analytics: all groups → CanViewAnalytics\n    Issues: group → CanCreateIssue, DELETE → CanManageIssues\n    Inventory: GETs → CanViewInventory, writes → CanManageInventory\n    InventoryIssues: group → CanCreateIssue, DELETE → CanManageIssues\n    Admin/Users: → CanManageUsers (replaces hardcoded AdminOnly)","tree":{"sha":"f1b3ce5ad497e578ce427a40736cc34ab298ccb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/f1b3ce5ad497e578ce427a40736cc34ab298ccb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/2c608c491fecae50e77c44bfa8261a3f741e9c1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/2c608c491fecae50e77c44bfa8261a3f741e9c1c","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDJjNjA4YzQ5MWZlY2FlNTBlNzdjNDRiZmE4MjYxYTNmNzQxZTljMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/c8395eee4aa2f937ed3f0f677f7558a89fdeae8c","sha":"c8395eee4aa2f937ed3f0f677f7558a89fdeae8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/c8395eee4aa2f937ed3f0f677f7558a89fdeae8c"}],"sha":"2c608c491fecae50e77c44bfa8261a3f741e9c1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/2c608c491fecae50e77c44bfa8261a3f741e9c1c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/c8395eee4aa2f937ed3f0f677f7558a89fdeae8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:33:21Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:33:21Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(tests): implement US-051 to US-054 — unit and integration tests for Analytics, Auth, InventoryIssues\n\nUS-051: AnalyticsHandlerTests — 6 unit tests covering GetIssueSummary, GetIssueTrends,\n  GetIssueStatsByStatus, GetIssueStatsByPriority, GetDashboard, GetAllUsersWorkload\n  with mocked IAnalyticsReadRepository (Moq)\n\nUS-052: AuthServiceTests — 14 unit tests covering JwtTokenService (token generation,\n  claims, refresh token uniqueness) and AuthenticationService (register happy path,\n  duplicate username/email, login correct/wrong/inactive, refresh token, GetUserInfo)\n  using EF InMemory AuthDbContext\n\nUS-053: InventoryIssueHandlerTests — 15 unit tests covering all command handlers\n  (Create, Update, Assign, Resolve, Close, Reopen, Delete) + domain entity lifecycle\n  (status transitions, ArgumentException on empty title) using EF InMemory + real repo\n\nUS-054: IssuesApiIntegrationTests + AnalyticsApiIntegrationTests — integration tests\n  covering full Issue lifecycle (Create→InProgress→Resolved), CRUD endpoints,\n  auth guards (401 unauthenticated), and all Analytics endpoints returning 200\n  with valid JSON structure after seed","tree":{"sha":"1db5e84947a5b4d814a4e43d3c0b8cbf8ef4ac18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/1db5e84947a5b4d814a4e43d3c0b8cbf8ef4ac18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/c8395eee4aa2f937ed3f0f677f7558a89fdeae8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/c8395eee4aa2f937ed3f0f677f7558a89fdeae8c","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKGM4Mzk1ZWVlNGFhMmY5MzdlZDNmMGY2NzdmNzU1OGE4OWZkZWFlOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/d91c53051bc4ca30bf59eb307739842b976bf5c0","sha":"d91c53051bc4ca30bf59eb307739842b976bf5c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/d91c53051bc4ca30bf59eb307739842b976bf5c0"}],"sha":"c8395eee4aa2f937ed3f0f677f7558a89fdeae8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/c8395eee4aa2f937ed3f0f677f7558a89fdeae8c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/d91c53051bc4ca30bf59eb307739842b976bf5c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:12:42Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:12:42Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat: US-056 CORS restrito + US-063 export analytics no frontend\n\nUS-056 — CORS restrito para origens conhecidas em produção\n- Program.cs: AddCors bifurca por ambiente — Development mantém AllowAnyOrigin,\n  Production usa WithOrigins() lendo Cors:AllowedOrigins da config\n- appsettings.json: adiciona Cors.AllowedOrigins com fallback localhost:3000\n- appsettings.Production.json: adiciona Cors.AllowedOrigins com\n  http://frontend:3000 (Docker interno) e http://localhost:3000\n- Validado: localhost:3000 recebe Access-Control-Allow-Origin;\n  evil.com não recebe header ACAO (bloqueado)\n\nUS-063 — Botão de export de analytics no frontend\n- components/analytics/export-button.tsx: componente client-side com\n  dropdown JSON/CSV, dispara download via blob URL, trata erro inline\n- app/(dashboard)/analytics/page.tsx: adiciona ExportButton no header\n  da página ao lado do título","tree":{"sha":"2a156460fc488dcaa0460ba89b67741fa76312ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/2a156460fc488dcaa0460ba89b67741fa76312ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/d91c53051bc4ca30bf59eb307739842b976bf5c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/d91c53051bc4ca30bf59eb307739842b976bf5c0","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKGQ5MWM1MzA1MWJjNGNhMzBiZjU5ZWIzMDc3Mzk4NDJiOTc2YmY1YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/4116772da415bab4120d6eafc083d692dc4a8c51","sha":"4116772da415bab4120d6eafc083d692dc4a8c51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/4116772da415bab4120d6eafc083d692dc4a8c51"}],"sha":"d91c53051bc4ca30bf59eb307739842b976bf5c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/d91c53051bc4ca30bf59eb307739842b976bf5c0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/4116772da415bab4120d6eafc083d692dc4a8c51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T13:56:19Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T13:56:19Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"fix(tests): US-050 — injetar ICacheService e ILogger nos command handlers\n\n- IssueCommandHandlerTests: adiciona Mock<ICacheService> (_cacheMock) com setup\n  no-op para RemoveByPrefixAsync; passa _cacheMock.Object em todos os handlers\n  que recebem ICacheService (CreateIssueCommandHandler)\n- InventoryCommandHandlerTests: adiciona Mock<ICacheService> (_cache) com setup\n  no-op para RemoveAsync e RemoveByPrefixAsync; passa _cache.Object nos handlers\n  CreateProduct, UpdateProduct, DeleteProduct, AdjustStock\n- Remove UnitTest1.cs placeholder\n- Atualiza comentário da classe para referenciar US-050\n\nResultado: 62/62 unit tests passando (0 falhas)","tree":{"sha":"07a0f15251acd173964550a6b0cdd9b6c003a533","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/07a0f15251acd173964550a6b0cdd9b6c003a533"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/4116772da415bab4120d6eafc083d692dc4a8c51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/4116772da415bab4120d6eafc083d692dc4a8c51","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDQxMTY3NzJkYTQxNWJhYjQxMjBkNmVhZmMwODNkNjkyZGM0YThjNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/2388126e8619bcd0dd4193dc69fc918d7ed7fa28","sha":"2388126e8619bcd0dd4193dc69fc918d7ed7fa28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/2388126e8619bcd0dd4193dc69fc918d7ed7fa28"}],"sha":"4116772da415bab4120d6eafc083d692dc4a8c51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/4116772da415bab4120d6eafc083d692dc4a8c51"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/2388126e8619bcd0dd4193dc69fc918d7ed7fa28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T01:05:02Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T01:05:02Z","email":"levertonborges@gmail.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"docs: adiciona plano de evolução do projeto (EVOLUTION_PLAN.md)\n\nAnálise completa do estado atual e roadmap de evolução elaborado por Morpheus:\n- Diagnóstico: 3 débitos críticos (testes quebrados, módulo faltante, segurança)\n- 7 débitos técnicos catalogados (D-01 a D-10)\n- 5 fases de evolução: Estabilização, Segurança, Frontend, Backend, Infra\n- 13 novas User Stories (US-050 a US-064) com critérios de aceite e estimativas\n- Matriz de priorização e métricas de sucesso por fase\n- 4 decisões de arquitetura pendentes documentadas","tree":{"sha":"aab404eae660206ef8581fe291872aadf8e4a586","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/aab404eae660206ef8581fe291872aadf8e4a586"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/2388126e8619bcd0dd4193dc69fc918d7ed7fa28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/2388126e8619bcd0dd4193dc69fc918d7ed7fa28","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDIzODgxMjZlODYxOWJjZDBkZDQxOTNkYzY5ZmM5MThkN2VkN2ZhMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/41a7365aff54f6557554f8df83d04e3dca78d1f3","sha":"41a7365aff54f6557554f8df83d04e3dca78d1f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/41a7365aff54f6557554f8df83d04e3dca78d1f3"}],"sha":"2388126e8619bcd0dd4193dc69fc918d7ed7fa28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/2388126e8619bcd0dd4193dc69fc918d7ed7fa28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":