orrige blazor-host.tsx para carregar scripts via /public/_blazor/\n  e adiciona guard contra duplo Blazor.start() em navegação SPA\n\n- fix(frontend): adiciona scripts predev/prebuild no package.json do Next.js\n  para recompilar o Blazor WASM automaticamente antes de next dev / next build\n\n- docs: atualiza README com tech stack separado por backend/frontend, seção\n  Getting Started com fluxo Docker e setup manual corrigido\n\n- docs: atualiza TECHNICAL_GUIDE com seção detalhada de integração Next.js +\n  Blazor WASM, convenções de queries Dapper para PostgreSQL, e novos itens\n  de Troubleshooting (422 analytics, 404 _framework, Blazor already started)\n\nCo-authored-by: Leverton Borges <levertonborges@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"a82c7749bf059ef51f6e220ce26130c466d82c18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/a82c7749bf059ef51f6e220ce26130c466d82c18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/14d1b1c507b0d5b6fed3f7c55d0d2a95e6342c46","verification":{"payload":"tree a82c7749bf059ef51f6e220ce26130c466d82c18\nparent 60cdc10ac5eecd2305ac77a211e4446e8c0bb13c\nauthor peleverton <leverton.borges@gmail.com> 1776905371 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776905371 -0300\n\nfix: analytics dashboard e integração Blazor WASM no Next.js (#71)\n\n- fix(analytics): reescreve todas as SQL queries do AnalyticsReadRepository\n  para sintaxe PostgreSQL (aspas duplas nos identificadores, casts explícitos\n  ::int / ::float8, CURRENT_DATE/INTERVAL para datas, true/false para booleanos)\n\n- fix(analytics): corrige aliases PascalCase nas queries Dapper para mapear\n  corretamente para os record constructors C# (ex: COUNT(*)::int AS \"Count\")\n\n- fix(frontend): atualiza next.config.ts com rewrites beforeFiles para servir\n  recursos estáticos do Blazor (_framework/*, _content/*) incluindo caminhos\n  prefixados por página (ex: /analytics/_framework/...)\n\n- fix(frontend): corrige blazor-host.tsx para carregar scripts via /public/_blazor/\n  e adiciona guard contra duplo Blazor.start() em navegação SPA\n\n- fix(frontend): adiciona scripts predev/prebuild no package.json do Next.js\n  para recompilar o Blazor WASM automaticamente antes de next dev / next build\n\n- docs: atualiza README com tech stack separado por backend/frontend, seção\n  Getting Started com fluxo Docker e setup manual corrigido\n\n- docs: atualiza TECHNICAL_GUIDE com seção detalhada de integração Next.js +\n  Blazor WASM, convenções de queries Dapper para PostgreSQL, e novos itens\n  de Troubleshooting (422 analytics, 404 _framework, Blazor already started)\n\nCo-authored-by: Leverton Borges <levertonborges@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp6WybCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJl8QAEpaWczRuxGo5kiE+OHSF2AZ\nOksEnA8iZ5QBH8Eey1A/6nSm7KILsoDQdgi0pG6sHlSmoSJ/9gKDTISvv2uMPQjr\nk87UtSY2sWYBdqcXNtMGC5NxlrrVdD4sXq/l+dtqV+lHTV1EUu9iYYyVU4xMwM7Q\nslQO5HyydM9qlP3ee1xogXdqtZOcyX9b4L/ttXMpL9QCdD15/vz/Pv5afh36OdtL\n0PAsCEG90w05aMJvAtAdakyU2XYsUikQSsgOGQ67E5OwAnlywp8ItvXBTWYoD1BZ\nhU5V8ftFMZ4IGIxslLcvZO8i8Wi0NuR8/XV77bqM7RfhnB1jYWtHfPgB7MWhAZEA\n+80JJ5W+Whooz/R9tglZZbfErC9QOA8lnI02iOtJDcMq+SMlXI3EVrLHV69T6q7j\nZizMismgaFH4ZIpTlHJvmveKWDada8QKB5WU07bRGQqCun4DUxE2GEwBGai+iM5m\nRRea2SvoV+OFCyGcqyFuJz0gazQ/I76C232T7zLIQ913O/neMUFgjTTtUDYsVL4E\n4KKcUMZnbxDY+13qrMTTij8bEYNfOH/SFOoNV9FjNh2GGoEYZ/urVqZ0NT5+Ij/X\nvA0SZ7o+0yQWDUJoL2wc2Zh3qv64Yb9PDp1raXE5L7xBtWrDig9bjkISZ9TLD0T1\nbl3rjL1U9oGcgr8TAIpK\n=x15N\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-23T00:49:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.