.product_id, inventory.movement_type, inventory.quantity,\n  inventory.new_stock\n- RabbitMqMessageBusService.PublishAsync: StartActivity(''RabbitMQ.Publish'')\n  with OpenTelemetry semantic conventions (messaging.system, destination,\n  routing_key, message_type)\n\nTogether with existing spans in CreateIssue and OutboxProcessor, Jaeger\nnow shows the full trace: frontend → proxy → handler → outbox → rabbit.","tree":{"sha":"474214c1bd853ca66da62991d7f3f0fb956b6c9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/474214c1bd853ca66da62991d7f3f0fb956b6c9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/36b9200aa5cbc089ff4e0f37b927b596f34b8ba9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/36b9200aa5cbc089ff4e0f37b927b596f34b8ba9","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDM2YjkyMDBhYTVjYmMwODlmZjRlMGYzN2I5MjdiNTk2ZjM0YjhiYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/8068c6a09e04ae89d3e386bb8ee6f68157561583","sha":"8068c6a09e04ae89d3e386bb8ee6f68157561583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/8068c6a09e04ae89d3e386bb8ee6f68157561583"}],"sha":"36b9200aa5cbc089ff4e0f37b927b596f34b8ba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/36b9200aa5cbc089ff4e0f37b927b596f34b8ba9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/8068c6a09e04ae89d3e386bb8ee6f68157561583/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:27:27Z","email":"levertonborges@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:27:27Z","email":"levertonborges@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(issues): US-048 - IssueCreatedConsumerService broadcasts SignalR push notification\n\nAdd IssueCreatedConsumerService BackgroundService that:\n- Subscribes to queue ''ims.issues.created'' bound to exchange ''ims.issues''\n  with routing key ''issue.created''\n- Broadcasts ''NewIssue'' SignalR event to all connected clients via\n  IHubContext<NotificationsHub> with issueId, title, priority\n\nFrontend: update NewIssue handler payload type to include issueId and\nimprove toast title with emoji indicator.","tree":{"sha":"f3a1c1414cd1af7d49e1a48254b7afc5797b8e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/f3a1c1414cd1af7d49e1a48254b7afc5797b8e84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/8068c6a09e04ae89d3e386bb8ee6f68157561583","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/8068c6a09e04ae89d3e386bb8ee6f68157561583","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDgwNjhjNmEwOWUwNGFlODlkM2UzODZiYjhlZTZmNjgxNTc1NjE1ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/30449674311da58652f38bcd32b6c323d220112f","sha":"30449674311da58652f38bcd32b6c323d220112f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/30449674311da58652f38bcd32b6c323d220112f"}],"sha":"8068c6a09e04ae89d3e386bb8ee6f68157561583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/8068c6a09e04ae89d3e386bb8ee6f68157561583"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/30449674311da58652f38bcd32b6c323d220112f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:26:39Z","email":"levertonborges@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:26:39Z","email":"levertonborges@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Leverton Borges"},"message":"feat(inventory-issues): US-047 - LowStockConsumerService creates InventoryIssue from RabbitMQ\n\nAdd LowStockConsumerService BackgroundService that:\n- Subscribes to queue ''ims.inventory.low_stock_alert'' bound to exchange\n  ''ims.inventory'' with routing key ''inventory.low_stock_alert''\n- Guards against duplicate open issues per product (Shortage type)\n- Creates an InventoryIssue via MediatR with priority High/Critical\n  depending on whether the product is completely out of stock\n\nExtend IMessageBus.SubscribeAsync / RabbitMqMessageBusService /\nNullMessageBusService to accept optional exchange + bindingKey so queues\ncan be bound to topic exchanges at subscription time.","tree":{"sha":"5fa8da8d5b229d98c060d7b00b316a434e69db65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/trees/5fa8da8d5b229d98c060d7b00b316a434e69db65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/git/commits/30449674311da58652f38bcd32b6c323d220112f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/30449674311da58652f38bcd32b6c323d220112f","node_id":"C_kwDORdoDA9oAKDMwNDQ5Njc0MzExZGE1ODY1MmYzOGJjZDMyYjZjMzIzZDIyMDExMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/peleverton/ims-monolith/commit/65832b1a5f46c1f7647c42b4fb6ac3cb8f995218","sha":"65832b1a5f46c1f7647c42b4fb6ac3cb8f995218","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/65832b1a5f46c1f7647c42b4fb6ac3cb8f995218"}],"sha":"30449674311da58652f38bcd32b6c323d220112f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits/30449674311da58652f38bcd32b6c323d220112f"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/peleverton/ims-monolith/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=4f12c1d95808b720f5e8d426a2a4451226473956&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A58%3A55.605Z"}');
